},
["color"] = {
["r"] = 1,
["g"] = 1,
["b"] = 0.6235294342041016,
},
["text"] = "Eversong Arch Magister says: The Amani may not seem like a real threat to you, but given the opportunity, they'll take our lands and kill us all!",
