["type"] = "MONSTER_SAY",
},
["color"] = {
["r"] = 1,
["g"] = 1,
["b"] = 0.6235294342041016,
},
["text"] = "Belath Dawnblade says: Where is Zaen?",
["timestamp"] = 1772274483,
["id"] = "s0_3848",
},
{
["recordedBy"] = "Kvotheen-Hyjal",
["typeInfo"] = {
["player"] = {
["name"] = "Silvermoon Dockworker",
},
["event"] = "CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY",
["type"] = "MONSTER_SAY",
},
["color"] = {
["r"] = 1,
["g"] = 1,
["b"] = 0.6235294342041016,
},
["text"] = "Silvermoon Dockworker says: I-I don't know. I just move cargo. I swear!",
["timestamp"] = 1772274486,
["id"] = "s0_3849",
},
{
["recordedBy"] = "Kvotheen-Hyjal",
["typeInfo"] = {
["player"] = {
["name"] = "Belath Dawnblade",
},
["event"] = "CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY",
["type"] = "MONSTER_SAY",
},
["color"] = {
["r"] = 1,
["g"] = 1,
["b"] = 0.6235294342041016,
},
["text"] = "Belath Dawnblade says: Leave. Find a different line of work.",
["timestamp"] = 1772274490,
["id"] = "s0_3850",
},
{
["recordedBy"] = "Kvotheen-Hyjal",
["typeInfo"] = {
["player"] = {
["name"] = "Belath Dawnblade",
},
["event"] = "CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY",
["type"] = "MONSTER_SAY",
},
["color"] = {
["r"] = 1,
["g"] = 1,
["b"] = 0.6235294342041016,
},
["text"] = "Belath Dawnblade says: Quickly! Let's get back to the Row. We need to locate the Illicit Rain, track down Zaen, and put an end to this fel trade.",
["timestamp"] = 1772274525,
["id"] = "s0_3851",
},
{
["recordedBy"] = "Kvotheen-Hyjal",
["typeInfo"] = {
["player"] = {
["name"] = "Magister Aradis",
},
["event"] = "CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY",
["type"] = "MONSTER_SAY",
},
["color"] = {
["r"] = 1,
["g"] = 1,
["b"] = 0.6235294342041016,
},
["text"] = "Magister Aradis says: Pure arcane... This should be simple enough.",
["timestamp"] = 1772274543,
["id"] = "s0_3852",
},
{
["recordedBy"] = "Kvotheen-Hyjal",
["typeInfo"] = {
["player"] = {
["name"] = "Magister Aradis",
},
["event"] = "CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY",
["type"] = "MONSTER_SAY",
},
["color"] = {
["r"] = 1,
["g"] = 1,
["b"] = 0.6235294342041016,
},
["text"] = "Magister Aradis says: Take the wardbreaker and charge it using the reservoirs around my study. I trust this task is simple enough for you to manage.",
["timestamp"] = 1772274570,
["id"] = "s0_3853",
},
{
["recordedBy"] = "Kvotheen-Hyjal",
["typeInfo"] = {
["player"] = {
["class"] = "SHAMAN",
["race"] = "ZandalariTroll",
["name"] = "Kvotheen-Hyjal",
["sex"] = 2,
},
["event"] = "CHAT_MSG_LOOT",
["type"] = "LOOT",
},
["color"] = {
["r"] = 0,
["g"] = 0.6666666865348816,
["b"] = 0,
},
["text"] = "You receive loot: |cnIQ1:|Hitem:239511::::::::83:263:::::::::|h[Depleted Wardbreaker]|h|r",
["timestamp"] = 1772274574,
["id"] = "s0_3854",
},
{
["recordedBy"] = "Kvotheen-Hyjal",
["typeInfo"] = {
["player"] = {
["name"] = "Magister Aradis",
},
["event"] = "CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY",
["type"] = "MONSTER_SAY",
},
["color"] = {
["r"] = 1,
["g"] = 1,
["b"] = 0.6235294342041016,
},
["text"] = "Magister Aradis says: As I was saying, the wardsmiths are led by Magister Dawnblaze. She inherited the vacant seat following the war but has proven inadequate since then.",
["timestamp"] = 1772274574,
["id"] = "s0_3855",
},
{
["recordedBy"] = "Kvotheen-Hyjal",
["typeInfo"] = {
["player"] = {
["name"] = "Magister Aradis",
},
["event"] = "CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY",
["type"] = "MONSTER_SAY",
},
["color"] = {
["r"] = 1,
["g"] = 1,
["b"] = 0.6235294342041016,
},
["text"] = "Magister Aradis says: She does not adapt to the new challenges the sin'dorei face. That is why I proffered myself to take her seat.",
["timestamp"] = 1772274590,
["id"] = "s0_3856",
},
{
["recordedBy"] = "Kvotheen-Hyjal",
["typeInfo"] = {
["player"] = {
["name"] = "Magister Aradis",
},
["event"] = "CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY",
["type"] = "MONSTER_SAY",
},
["color"] = {
["r"] = 1,
["g"] = 1,
["b"] = 0.6235294342041016,
},
["text"] = "Magister Aradis says: She has fabricated blackmail against me in an attempt to prevent this. You can see how this is a great injustice.",
["timestamp"] = 1772274592,
["id"] = "s0_3857",
},
{
["recordedBy"] = "Kvotheen-Hyjal",
["typeInfo"] = {
["player"] = {
["name"] = "Magister Aradis",
},
["event"] = "CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY",
["type"] = "MONSTER_SAY",
},
["color"] = {
["r"] = 1,
["g"] = 1,
["b"] = 0.6235294342041016,
},
["text"] = "Magister Aradis says: Ugh, your form is terrible. Do not move while it is siphoning. You will warp the aetheric flow.",
["timestamp"] = 1772274598,
["id"] = "s0_3858",
},
{
["recordedBy"] = "Kvotheen-Hyjal",
["typeInfo"] = {
["player"] = {
["name"] = "Magister Aradis",
},
["event"] = "CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY",
["type"] = "MONSTER_SAY",
},
["color"] = {
["r"] = 1,
["g"] = 1,
["b"] = 0.6235294342041016,
},
["text"] = "Magister Aradis says: Still terrible, but the wardbreaker is sufficiently charged, I suppose. Come here.",
["timestamp"] = 1772274600,
["id"] = "s0_3859",
},
{
["recordedBy"] = "Kvotheen-Hyjal",
["typeInfo"] = {
["player"] = {
["name"] = "Magister Aradis",
},
["event"] = "CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY",
["type"] = "MONSTER_SAY",
},
["color"] = {
["r"] = 1,
["g"] = 1,
["b"] = 0.6235294342041016,
},
["text"] = "Magister Aradis says: The wardbreaker is attuned to the arcane magic guarding this conduit. Use it and the shield will break.",
["timestamp"] = 1772274647,
["id"] = "s0_3860",
},
{
["recordedBy"] = "Kvotheen-Hyjal",
["typeInfo"] = {
["player"] = {
["name"] = "Magister Aradis",
},
["event"] = "CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY",
["type"] = "MONSTER_SAY",
},
["color"] = {
["r"] = 1,
["g"] = 1,
["b"] = 0.6235294342041016,
},
["text"] = "Magister Aradis says: Splendid. This conduit will take you to the next link in the chain. Do attempt not to fail.",
["timestamp"] = 1772274650,
["id"] = "s0_3861",
},
{
["recordedBy"] = "Kvotheen-Hyjal",
["typeInfo"] = {
["player"] = {
["name"] = "Magister Aradis",
},
["event"] = "CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY",
["type"] = "MONSTER_SAY",
},
["color"] = {
["r"] = 1,
["g"] = 1,
["b"] = 0.6235294342041016,
},
["text"] = "Magister Aradis says: Ah, her protection dwindles. My magic was thwarted from reaching here, but no longer.",
["timestamp"] = 1772274769,
["id"] = "s0_3862",
},
{
["recordedBy"] = "Kvotheen-Hyjal",
["typeInfo"] = {
["player"] = {
["name"] = "Magister Aradis",
},
["event"] = "CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY",
["type"] = "MONSTER_SAY",
},
["color"] = {
["r"] = 1,
["g"] = 1,
["b"] = 0.6235294342041016,
},
["text"] = "Magister Aradis says: All that matters is retrieving those documents. Do not fail me.",
["timestamp"] = 1772274798,
["id"] = "s0_3863",
},
{
["recordedBy"] = "Kvotheen-Hyjal",
["typeInfo"] = {
["player"] = {
["class"] = "SHAMAN",
["race"] = "ZandalariTroll",
["name"] = "Kvotheen-Hyjal",
["sex"] = 2,
},
["event"] = "CHAT_MSG_LOOT",
["type"] = "LOOT",
},
["color"] = {
["r"] = 0,
["g"] = 0.6666666865348816,
["b"] = 0,
},
["text"] = "You receive loot: |cnIQ1:|Hitem:239608::::::::83:263:::::::::|h[Incriminating Documents]|h|r",
["timestamp"] = 1772274812,
["id"] = "s0_3864",
},
{
