},
["color"] = {
["r"] = 0.250980406999588,
["g"] = 1,
["b"] = 0.250980406999588,
},
["text"] = "|Hplayer:Tripadvisør-KirinTor|h[|cffc69b6dTripadvisør-KirinTor|r]|h a accompli le haut fait |cffffff00|Hachievement:61638:Player-1127-0908264E:1:2:28:26:4294967295:4294967295:4294967295:4294967295|h[Den of Nalorakk]|h|r !",
["timestamp"] = 1772274812,
["id"] = "s0_3865",
},
{
["recordedBy"] = "Kvotheen-Hyjal",
["typeInfo"] = {
["player"] = {
["name"] = "Magister Dawnblaze",
},
["event"] = "CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY",
["type"] = "MONSTER_SAY",
},
["color"] = {
["r"] = 1,
["g"] = 1,
["b"] = 0.6235294342041016,
},
["text"] = "Magister Dawnblaze says: Ah, there you are. The dreadfully conspicuous thief dispelling my wards.",
["timestamp"] = 1772274814,
["id"] = "s0_3866",
},
{
["recordedBy"] = "Kvotheen-Hyjal",
["typeInfo"] = {
["player"] = {
["name"] = "Magister Dawnblaze",
},
["event"] = "CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY",
["type"] = "MONSTER_SAY",
},
["color"] = {
["r"] = 1,
["g"] = 1,
["b"] = 0.6235294342041016,
},
["text"] = "Magister Dawnblaze says: Given the papers you hold, I presume Aradis put you up to this. Come here and I will not call the guards.",
["timestamp"] = 1772274820,
["id"] = "s0_3867",
},
{
["recordedBy"] = "Kvotheen-Hyjal",
["typeInfo"] = {
["player"] = {
["class"] = "SHAMAN",
["race"] = "ZandalariTroll",
["name"] = "Kvotheen-Hyjal",
["sex"] = 2,
},
["event"] = "CHAT_MSG_LOOT",
["type"] = "LOOT",
},
["color"] = {
["r"] = 0,
["g"] = 0.6666666865348816,
["b"] = 0,
},
["text"] = "You receive item: |cnIQ1:|Hitem:259992::::::::83:263:::::::::|h[Duplicate Documents]|h|r",
["timestamp"] = 1772274857,
["id"] = "s0_3868",
},
{
["recordedBy"] = "Kvotheen-Hyjal",
["typeInfo"] = {
["player"] = {
["name"] = "Magister Dawnblaze",
},
["event"] = "CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY",
["type"] = "MONSTER_SAY",
},
["color"] = {
["r"] = 1,
["g"] = 1,
["b"] = 0.6235294342041016,
},
["text"] = "Magister Dawnblaze says: Jaeth has done some... prior work for me. And I happen to know he might have a special interest in Aradis.",
["timestamp"] = 1772274857,
["id"] = "s0_3869",
},
{
["recordedBy"] = "Kvotheen-Hyjal",
["typeInfo"] = {
["player"] = {
["name"] = "Magister Dawnblaze",
},
["event"] = "CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY",
["type"] = "MONSTER_SAY",
},
["color"] = {
["r"] = 1,
["g"] = 1,
["b"] = 0.6235294342041016,
},
["text"] = "Magister Dawnblaze says: Take these duplicates of the documents. Do let him know I would be willing to part with a sum of gold to see the situation remedied.",
["timestamp"] = 1772274863,
["id"] = "s0_3870",
},
{
["recordedBy"] = "Kvotheen-Hyjal",
["typeInfo"] = {
