["type"] = "MONSTER_SAY",
},
["color"] = {
["r"] = 1,
["g"] = 1,
["b"] = 0.6235294342041016,
},
["text"] = "Jaeth says: The shops we'll hit sell to the upper ranks of Silvermoon. Meaning they'll have the good stuff, and I don't give a damn if they lose gold over it.",
["timestamp"] = 1772275251,
["id"] = "s0_3889",
},
{
["recordedBy"] = "Kvotheen-Hyjal",
["typeInfo"] = {
["player"] = {
["name"] = "Jaeth",
},
["event"] = "CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY",
["type"] = "MONSTER_SAY",
},
["color"] = {
["r"] = 1,
["g"] = 1,
["b"] = 0.6235294342041016,
},
["text"] = "Jaeth says: We'll start here. Distract the worker over there while I sneak inside.",
["timestamp"] = 1772275271,
["id"] = "s0_3890",
},
{
["recordedBy"] = "Kvotheen-Hyjal",
["typeInfo"] = {
["player"] = {
["class"] = "SHAMAN",
["race"] = "ZandalariTroll",
["name"] = "Kvotheen-Hyjal",
["sex"] = 2,
},
["event"] = "CHAT_MSG_LOOT",
["type"] = "LOOT",
},
["color"] = {
["r"] = 0,
["g"] = 0.6666666865348816,
["b"] = 0,
},
["text"] = "You receive loot: |cnIQ1:|Hitem:241205::::::::83:263:::::::::|h[Thrumming Amulet]|h|r",
["timestamp"] = 1772275289,
["id"] = "s0_3891",
},
{
["recordedBy"] = "Kvotheen-Hyjal",
["typeInfo"] = {
["player"] = {
["name"] = "Jaeth",
},
["event"] = "CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_WHISPER",
["type"] = "MONSTER_WHISPER",
},
["color"] = {
["r"] = 1,
["g"] = 0.7098039388656616,
["b"] = 0.9215686917304993,
},
["text"] = "Jaeth whispers: Found a magical necklace that should work. Let's get out of here.",
["timestamp"] = 1772275289,
["id"] = "s0_3892",
},
{
["recordedBy"] = "Kvotheen-Hyjal",
["typeInfo"] = {
["player"] = {
["name"] = "Lendranil",
},
["event"] = "CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY",
["type"] = "MONSTER_SAY",
},
["color"] = {
["r"] = 1,
["g"] = 1,
["b"] = 0.6235294342041016,
},
["text"] = "Lendranil says: ...and you mentioned spell penetration? I'll have to bring in a specialist for that one. Come back in a few days.",
["timestamp"] = 1772275293,
["id"] = "s0_3893",
},
{
["recordedBy"] = "Kvotheen-Hyjal",
["typeInfo"] = {
["player"] = {
["name"] = "Jaeth",
},
["event"] = "CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY",
["type"] = "MONSTER_SAY",
},
["color"] = {
["r"] = 1,
["g"] = 1,
["b"] = 0.6235294342041016,
},
["text"] = "Jaeth says: Over here. Same deal as before: you talk their ears off while I get inside.",
["timestamp"] = 1772275311,
["id"] = "s0_3894",
},
{
["recordedBy"] = "Kvotheen-Hyjal",
["typeInfo"] = {
["player"] = {
["class"] = "SHAMAN",
["race"] = "ZandalariTroll",
["name"] = "Kvotheen-Hyjal",
["sex"] = 2,
},
["event"] = "CHAT_MSG_LOOT",
["type"] = "LOOT",
},
["color"] = {
["r"] = 0,
["g"] = 0.6666666865348816,
["b"] = 0,
},
["text"] = "You receive loot: |cnIQ1:|Hitem:241208::::::::83:263:::::::::|h[Basket of Spell Reagents]|h|r",
["timestamp"] = 1772275331,
["id"] = "s0_3895",
},
{
["recordedBy"] = "Kvotheen-Hyjal",
["typeInfo"] = {
["player"] = {
["name"] = "Jaeth",
},
["event"] = "CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_WHISPER",
["type"] = "MONSTER_WHISPER",
},
["color"] = {
["r"] = 1,
["g"] = 0.7098039388656616,
["b"] = 0.9215686917304993,
},
["text"] = "Jaeth whispers: Lots of magic in these reagents. Let's go. One more mark to hit.",
["timestamp"] = 1772275332,
["id"] = "s0_3896",
},
{
["recordedBy"] = "Kvotheen-Hyjal",
["typeInfo"] = {
["player"] = {
["name"] = "Lothene",
},
["event"] = "CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY",
["type"] = "MONSTER_SAY",
},
["color"] = {
["r"] = 1,
["g"] = 1,
["b"] = 0.6235294342041016,
},
["text"] = "Lothene says: ...so with the spider legs, viscous fluid, and random pebbles included, this would be your itemized list. Pleasure doing business with you.",
["timestamp"] = 1772275335,
["id"] = "s0_3897",
},
{
["recordedBy"] = "Kvotheen-Hyjal",
["typeInfo"] = {
["player"] = {
["name"] = "Jaeth",
},
["event"] = "CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY",
["type"] = "MONSTER_SAY",
},
["color"] = {
["r"] = 1,
["g"] = 1,
["b"] = 0.6235294342041016,
},
["text"] = "Jaeth says: Our last target. Lot more eyes on this one, but I can get around them. Distract the worker for me again.",
["timestamp"] = 1772275369,
["id"] = "s0_3898",
},
{
["recordedBy"] = "Kvotheen-Hyjal",
["typeInfo"] = {
["player"] = {
["class"] = "SHAMAN",
["race"] = "ZandalariTroll",
["name"] = "Kvotheen-Hyjal",
["sex"] = 2,
},
["event"] = "CHAT_MSG_LOOT",
["type"] = "LOOT",
},
["color"] = {
["r"] = 0,
["g"] = 0.6666666865348816,
["b"] = 0,
},
["text"] = "You receive loot: |cnIQ1:|Hitem:241207::::::::83:263:::::::::|h[Arcane Sword]|h|r",
["timestamp"] = 1772275395,
["id"] = "s0_3899",
},
{
["recordedBy"] = "Kvotheen-Hyjal",
["typeInfo"] = {
["player"] = {
["name"] = "Jaeth",
},
["event"] = "CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_WHISPER",
["type"] = "MONSTER_WHISPER",
},
["color"] = {
["r"] = 1,
["g"] = 0.7098039388656616,
["b"] = 0.9215686917304993,
},
["text"] = "Jaeth whispers: This sword looks like it has some juice in it. Let's get back to the Row.",
["timestamp"] = 1772275396,
["id"] = "s0_3900",
},
{
["recordedBy"] = "Kvotheen-Hyjal",
["typeInfo"] = {
["player"] = {
["name"] = "Belil",
},
["event"] = "CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY",
["type"] = "MONSTER_SAY",
},
["color"] = {
["r"] = 1,
["g"] = 1,
["b"] = 0.6235294342041016,
},
["text"] = "Belil says: ...and now a lot of people think slate and shale are the same, but slate is actually--wait, where are you going?",
["timestamp"] = 1772275399,
["id"] = "s0_3901",
},
{
["recordedBy"] = "Kvotheen-Hyjal",
["typeInfo"] = {
["player"] = {
["name"] = "Zanien",
},
["event"] = "CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY",
["type"] = "MONSTER_SAY",
},
["color"] = {
["r"] = 1,
["g"] = 1,
["b"] = 0.6235294342041016,
},
["text"] = "Zanien says: A functional wardbreaker, you say? Those are worth quite the coin.",
["timestamp"] = 1772275411,
["id"] = "s0_3902",
},
{
["recordedBy"] = "Kvotheen-Hyjal",
["typeInfo"] = {
["player"] = {
["name"] = "Jaeth",
},
["event"] = "CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY",
["type"] = "MONSTER_SAY",
},
["color"] = {
["r"] = 1,
["g"] = 1,
["b"] = 0.6235294342041016,
},
["text"] = "Jaeth says: Killing this warlock is worth more. We just need the thing attuned to break his wards.",
["timestamp"] = 1772275415,
["id"] = "s0_3903",
},
{
["recordedBy"] = "Kvotheen-Hyjal",
["typeInfo"] = {
["player"] = {
["name"] = "Zanien",
},
["event"] = "CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY",
["type"] = "MONSTER_SAY",
},
["color"] = {
["r"] = 1,
["g"] = 1,
["b"] = 0.6235294342041016,
},
["text"] = "Zanien says: Place the wardbreaker on the altar. I will draw the magic out of these items to reattune it.",
["timestamp"] = 1772275433,
["id"] = "s0_3904",
},
{
["recordedBy"] = "Kvotheen-Hyjal",
["typeInfo"] = {
["player"] = {
["name"] = "Zanien",
},
["event"] = "CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY",
["type"] = "MONSTER_SAY",
},
["color"] = {
["r"] = 1,
["g"] = 1,
["b"] = 0.6235294342041016,
},
["text"] = "Zanien says: Fel is a tool that offers great and dangerous power. The sin'dorei understand this well.",
["timestamp"] = 1772275440,
["id"] = "s0_3905",
},
{
["recordedBy"] = "Kvotheen-Hyjal",
["typeInfo"] = {
["player"] = {
["name"] = "Zanien",
},
["event"] = "CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY",
["type"] = "MONSTER_SAY",
},
["color"] = {
["r"] = 1,
["g"] = 1,
["b"] = 0.6235294342041016,
},
["text"] = "Zanien says: But tools must be wielded carefully. We can neither grasp it weakly nor allow it to wield us in turn.",
["timestamp"] = 1772275446,
["id"] = "s0_3906",
},
{
["recordedBy"] = "Kvotheen-Hyjal",
["typeInfo"] = {
["player"] = {
["name"] = "Zanien",
},
["event"] = "CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY",
["type"] = "MONSTER_SAY",
},
["color"] = {
["r"] = 1,
["g"] = 1,
["b"] = 0.6235294342041016,
},
["text"] = "Zanien says: All warlocks must walk that line between cowardice and temptation.",
["timestamp"] = 1772275451,
["id"] = "s0_3907",
},
{
["recordedBy"] = "Kvotheen-Hyjal",
["typeInfo"] = {
["player"] = {
["name"] = "Zanien",
},
["event"] = "CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY",
["type"] = "MONSTER_SAY",
},
["color"] = {
["r"] = 1,
["g"] = 1,
["b"] = 0.6235294342041016,
},
["text"] = "Zanien says: If Aradis has bent to one side like a weakling, he deserves his pathetic end.",
["timestamp"] = 1772275454,
["id"] = "s0_3908",
},
{
["recordedBy"] = "Kvotheen-Hyjal",
["typeInfo"] = {
["player"] = {
["class"] = "SHAMAN",
["race"] = "ZandalariTroll",
["name"] = "Kvotheen-Hyjal",
["sex"] = 2,
},
["event"] = "CHAT_MSG_LOOT",
["type"] = "LOOT",
},
["color"] = {
["r"] = 0,
["g"] = 0.6666666865348816,
["b"] = 0,
},
["text"] = "You receive loot: |cnIQ1:|Hitem:242253::::::::83:263:::::::::|h[Recharged Wardbreaker]|h|r",
["timestamp"] = 1772275460,
["id"] = "s0_3909",
},
{
["recordedBy"] = "Kvotheen-Hyjal",
["typeInfo"] = {
["player"] = {
["name"] = "Zanien",
},
["event"] = "CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY",
["type"] = "MONSTER_SAY",
},
["color"] = {
["r"] = 1,
["g"] = 1,
["b"] = 0.6235294342041016,
},
["text"] = "Zanien says: I will take great joy in hearing an \"interesting\" story about Aradis tomorrow.",
["timestamp"] = 1772275461,
["id"] = "s0_3910",
},
{
["recordedBy"] = "Kvotheen-Hyjal",
["typeInfo"] = {
["player"] = {
["name"] = "Jaeth",
},
["event"] = "CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY",
["type"] = "MONSTER_SAY",
},
["color"] = {
["r"] = 1,
["g"] = 1,
["b"] = 0.6235294342041016,
},
["text"] = "Jaeth says: I'll tell you all about it. Come on, Kvotheen. We have a throat to cut.",
["timestamp"] = 1772275466,
["id"] = "s0_3911",
},
{
["recordedBy"] = "Kvotheen-Hyjal",
["typeInfo"] = {
["player"] = {
["name"] = "Jaeth",
},
["event"] = "CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY",
["type"] = "MONSTER_SAY",
},
["color"] = {
["r"] = 1,
["g"] = 1,
["b"] = 0.6235294342041016,
},
["text"] = "Jaeth says: No sign of Aradis yet, but I hear something past this ward. Be on your guard.",
["timestamp"] = 1772275486,
["id"] = "s0_3912",
},
{
["recordedBy"] = "Kvotheen-Hyjal",
["typeInfo"] = {
["player"] = {
["name"] = "Jaeth",
},
["event"] = "CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY",
["type"] = "MONSTER_SAY",
},
["color"] = {
["r"] = 1,
["g"] = 1,
["b"] = 0.6235294342041016,
},
["text"] = "Jaeth says: Let's make him regret giving you that staff.",
["timestamp"] = 1772275506,
["id"] = "s0_3913",
},
{
["recordedBy"] = "Kvotheen-Hyjal",
["typeInfo"] = {
["player"] = {
["name"] = "Jaeth",
},
["event"] = "CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY",
["type"] = "MONSTER_SAY",
},
["color"] = {
["r"] = 1,
["g"] = 1,
["b"] = 0.6235294342041016,
},
["text"] = "Jaeth says: Come on! No time to waste.",
["timestamp"] = 1772275511,
["id"] = "s0_3914",
},
{
["recordedBy"] = "Kvotheen-Hyjal",
["typeInfo"] = {
["player"] = {
["name"] = "Jaeth",
},
["event"] = "CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY",
["type"] = "MONSTER_SAY",
},
["color"] = {
["r"] = 1,
["g"] = 1,
["b"] = 0.6235294342041016,
},
["text"] = "Jaeth says: What is this...",
["timestamp"] = 1772275519,
["id"] = "s0_3915",
},
{
["recordedBy"] = "Kvotheen-Hyjal",
["typeInfo"] = {
["player"] = {
["name"] = "Jaeth",
},
["event"] = "CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY",
["type"] = "MONSTER_SAY",
},
["color"] = {
["r"] = 1,
["g"] = 1,
["b"] = 0.6235294342041016,
},
["text"] = "Jaeth says: Damn it! Get everyone free from those crystals. I'll just--Sarvi, wake up!",
["timestamp"] = 1772275523,
["id"] = "s0_3916",
},
