["name"] = "Gaari",
},
["event"] = "CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY",
["type"] = "MONSTER_SAY",
},
["color"] = {
["b"] = 0.6235294342041016,
["g"] = 1,
["r"] = 1,
},
["text"] = "Gaari says: Thank you, again, for lending your talent to my cause.",
["id"] = "s0_4056",
["timestamp"] = 1772276582,
},
{
["recordedBy"] = "Kvotheen-Hyjal",
["typeInfo"] = {
["player"] = {
["name"] = "Solwin Brightstitch",
},
["event"] = "CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY",
["type"] = "MONSTER_SAY",
},
["color"] = {
["b"] = 0.6235294342041016,
["g"] = 1,
["r"] = 1,
},
["text"] = "Solwin Brightstitch says: Thank you for trusting me with such an important task--both for you and for me.",
["id"] = "s0_4057",
["timestamp"] = 1772276587,
},
{
["recordedBy"] = "Kvotheen-Hyjal",
["typeInfo"] = {
["player"] = {
["race"] = "ZandalariTroll",
["class"] = "SHAMAN",
["name"] = "Kvotheen-Hyjal",
["sex"] = 2,
},
["event"] = "CHAT_MSG_LOOT",
["type"] = "LOOT",
},
["color"] = {
["b"] = 0,
["g"] = 0.6666666865348816,
["r"] = 0,
},
["text"] = "You receive item: |cnIQ3:|Hitem:263438::::::::84:263::11:5:13573:13613:13615:6652:13668:2:9:83:28:3085:::::|h[Tarenar's Dusty Loop]|h|r",
["id"] = "s0_4058",
["timestamp"] = 1772276635,
},
{
["recordedBy"] = "Kvotheen-Hyjal",
["typeInfo"] = {
["player"] = {
["name"] = "Tarenar Sunstrike",
},
["event"] = "CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY",
["type"] = "MONSTER_SAY",
},
["color"] = {
["b"] = 0.6235294342041016,
["g"] = 1,
["r"] = 1,
},
["text"] = "Tarenar Sunstrike says: Here. This should more than cover our old tab... and the years of interest.",
["id"] = "s0_4059",
["timestamp"] = 1772276637,
},
{
["recordedBy"] = "Kvotheen-Hyjal",
["typeInfo"] = {
["player"] = {
["name"] = "Kiria Brightpalm",
},
["event"] = "CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY",
["type"] = "MONSTER_SAY",
},
["color"] = {
["b"] = 0.6235294342041016,
["g"] = 1,
["r"] = 1,
},
["text"] = "Kiria Brightpalm says: Finally. Thank you. That takes care of your outstanding debt.",
["id"] = "s0_4060",
["timestamp"] = 1772276643,
},
{
["recordedBy"] = "Kvotheen-Hyjal",
["typeInfo"] = {
["player"] = {
["name"] = "Kiria Brightpalm",
},
["event"] = "CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY",
["type"] = "MONSTER_SAY",
},
["color"] = {
["b"] = 0.6235294342041016,
["g"] = 1,
["r"] = 1,
},
["text"] = "Kiria Brightpalm says: I am required to inform you that you are no longer welcome at The Plucked Phoenix. Good day.",
["id"] = "s0_4061",
["timestamp"] = 1772276648,
},
{
["recordedBy"] = "Kvotheen-Hyjal",
["typeInfo"] = {
["player"] = {
["name"] = "Tarenar Sunstrike",
},
["event"] = "CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY",
["type"] = "MONSTER_SAY",
},
["color"] = {
["b"] = 0.6235294342041016,
["g"] = 1,
["r"] = 1,
},
["text"] = "Tarenar Sunstrike says: So... what happened? Is that webbing in your beard, Gidwin?",
["id"] = "s0_4062",
["timestamp"] = 1772276655,
},
{
["recordedBy"] = "Kvotheen-Hyjal",
["typeInfo"] = {
["player"] = {
["name"] = "Gidwin Goldbraids",
},
["event"] = "CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_EMOTE",
["type"] = "MONSTER_EMOTE",
},
["color"] = {
["b"] = 0.250980406999588,
["g"] = 0.501960813999176,
["r"] = 1,
},
["text"] = "Gidwin grumbles defensively under his breath.",
["id"] = "s0_4063",
["timestamp"] = 1772276660,
},
{
["recordedBy"] = "Kvotheen-Hyjal",
["typeInfo"] = {
["player"] = {
["name"] = "Gidwin Goldbraids",
},
["event"] = "CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY",
["type"] = "MONSTER_SAY",
},
["color"] = {
["b"] = 0.6235294342041016,
["g"] = 1,
["r"] = 1,
},
["text"] = "Gidwin Goldbraids says: The apartment is a disaster. But I found our old travel log.",
["id"] = "s0_4064",
["timestamp"] = 1772276663,
},
{
["recordedBy"] = "Kvotheen-Hyjal",
["typeInfo"] = {
["player"] = {
["name"] = "Tarenar Sunstrike",
},
["event"] = "CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY",
["type"] = "MONSTER_SAY",
},
["color"] = {
["b"] = 0.6235294342041016,
["g"] = 1,
["r"] = 1,
},
["text"] = "Tarenar Sunstrike says: Oh! Quite a few good memories recorded in there. And a few misadventures.",
["id"] = "s0_4065",
["timestamp"] = 1772276668,
},
{
["recordedBy"] = "Kvotheen-Hyjal",
["typeInfo"] = {
["player"] = {
["name"] = "Gidwin Goldbraids",
},
["event"] = "CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY",
["type"] = "MONSTER_SAY",
},
["color"] = {
["b"] = 0.6235294342041016,
["g"] = 1,
["r"] = 1,
},
["text"] = "Gidwin Goldbraids says: Aye. It's been so long since we were here. Think The Barbed Font will let us in?",
["id"] = "s0_4066",
["timestamp"] = 1772276674,
},
{
["recordedBy"] = "Kvotheen-Hyjal",
["typeInfo"] = {
["player"] = {
["name"] = "Tarenar Sunstrike",
},
["event"] = "CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY",
["type"] = "MONSTER_SAY",
},
["color"] = {
["b"] = 0.6235294342041016,
["g"] = 1,
["r"] = 1,
},
["text"] = "Tarenar Sunstrike says: Hmm... They might let me in, but probably not you. You don't meet the height requirement.",
["id"] = "s0_4067",
["timestamp"] = 1772276680,
},
{
["recordedBy"] = "Kvotheen-Hyjal",
["typeInfo"] = {
["player"] = {
["name"] = "Gidwin Goldbraids",
},
["event"] = "CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY",
["type"] = "MONSTER_SAY",
},
["color"] = {
["b"] = 0.6235294342041016,
["g"] = 1,
["r"] = 1,
},
["text"] = "Gidwin Goldbraids says: Oh, let's just get over there! Your teasing is more tolerable after an ale.",
["id"] = "s0_4068",
["timestamp"] = 1772276686,
},
