["r"] = 0.250980406999588,
},
["text"] = "|Hchannel:GUILD|h[Guild]|h |Hplayer:Jamelmoignon-Hyjal:1323:GUILD:|h[|cffffffffJamelmoignon|r]|h: j'ai pris une demi barre en montant un peu mes métiers mdrr",
["id"] = "s0_4264",
["timestamp"] = 1772279274,
},
{
["recordedBy"] = "Kvotheen-Hyjal",
["typeInfo"] = {
["player"] = {
["race"] = "Draenei",
["class"] = "PALADIN",
["name"] = "Cïarrah-KhazModan",
["sex"] = 3,
},
["event"] = "CHAT_MSG_GUILD_ACHIEVEMENT",
["type"] = "GUILD_ACHIEVEMENT",
},
["color"] = {
["b"] = 0.250980406999588,
["g"] = 1,
["r"] = 0.250980406999588,
},
["text"] = "|Hplayer:Cïarrah-KhazModan|h[|cfff48cbaCïarrah-KhazModan|r]|h a accompli le haut fait |cffffff00|Hachievement:40525:Player-3690-08F60A13:1:2:28:26:4294967295:4294967295:4294967295:4294967295|h[Fungal Folly Stories]|h|r !",
["id"] = "s0_4265",
["timestamp"] = 1772279404,
},
{
["recordedBy"] = "Kvotheen-Hyjal",
["typeInfo"] = {
["player"] = {
["class"] = "SHAMAN",
["race"] = "ZandalariTroll",
["name"] = "Kvotheen",
["sex"] = 2,
},
["event"] = "CHAT_MSG_RAID_BOSS_EMOTE",
["type"] = "MONSTER_BOSS_EMOTE",
},
["color"] = {
["r"] = 1,
["g"] = 0.8666667342185974,
["b"] = 0,
},
["text"] = "|TInterface\\ICONS\\Tracking_WildPet.blp:20|t  Track Pets via minimap to find wild pets.",
["timestamp"] = 1772289101,
["id"] = "s0_4266",
},
{
["recordedBy"] = "Kvotheen-Hyjal",
["typeInfo"] = {
["player"] = {
["name"] = "Zul'jarra",
},
["event"] = "CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY",
["type"] = "MONSTER_SAY",
},
["color"] = {
["r"] = 1,
["g"] = 1,
["b"] = 0.6235294342041016,
},
["text"] = "Zul'jarra says: For your own safety, I suggest you keep your blade sheathed and stay close to me in Amani'Zar.",
["timestamp"] = 1772289144,
["id"] = "s0_4267",
},
{
["recordedBy"] = "Kvotheen-Hyjal",
["typeInfo"] = {
["player"] = {
["name"] = "Zul'jarra",
},
["event"] = "CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY",
["type"] = "MONSTER_SAY",
},
["color"] = {
["r"] = 1,
["g"] = 1,
["b"] = 0.6235294342041016,
},
["text"] = "Zul'jarra says: Come with me. De leaders of de forest tribes have gathered to discuss our war plan.",
["timestamp"] = 1772289186,
["id"] = "s0_4268",
},
{
["recordedBy"] = "Kvotheen-Hyjal",
["typeInfo"] = {
["player"] = {
["name"] = "Zul'jan",
},
["event"] = "CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY",
["type"] = "MONSTER_SAY",
},
["color"] = {
["r"] = 1,
["g"] = 1,
["b"] = 0.6235294342041016,
},
["text"] = "Zul'jan says: Where were all of you when de drums sounded? You let Atal'Aman fall!",
["timestamp"] = 1772289242,
["id"] = "s0_4269",
},
{
["recordedBy"] = "Kvotheen-Hyjal",
["typeInfo"] = {
["player"] = {
["name"] = "Zul'jarra",
},
["event"] = "CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY",
["type"] = "MONSTER_SAY",
},
["color"] = {
["r"] = 1,
["g"] = 1,
["b"] = 0.6235294342041016,
},
["text"] = "Zul'jarra says: Atal'Aman has fallen.",
["timestamp"] = 1772289255,
["id"] = "s0_4270",
},
{
["recordedBy"] = "Kvotheen-Hyjal",
["typeInfo"] = {
["player"] = {
["name"] = "Zul'jan",
},
["event"] = "CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY",
["type"] = "MONSTER_SAY",
},
["color"] = {
["r"] = 1,
["g"] = 1,
["b"] = 0.6235294342041016,
},
["text"] = "Zul'jan says: No thanks to all of you!",
["timestamp"] = 1772289257,
["id"] = "s0_4271",
},
{
["recordedBy"] = "Kvotheen-Hyjal",
["typeInfo"] = {
["player"] = {
["name"] = "Kul'amara the Fierce",
},
["event"] = "CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY",
["type"] = "MONSTER_SAY",
},
["color"] = {
["r"] = 1,
["g"] = 1,
["b"] = 0.6235294342041016,
},
["text"] = "Kul'amara the Fierce says: We are under attack. De Vilebranch--",
["timestamp"] = 1772289261,
["id"] = "s0_4272",
},
{
["recordedBy"] = "Kvotheen-Hyjal",
["typeInfo"] = {
["player"] = {
["name"] = "Zul'jarra",
},
["event"] = "CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY",
["type"] = "MONSTER_SAY",
},
["color"] = {
["r"] = 1,
["g"] = 1,
["b"] = 0.6235294342041016,
},
["text"] = "Zul'jarra says: No time for barin' our tusks. We need a plan. Torundo?",
["timestamp"] = 1772289263,
["id"] = "s0_4273",
},
{
["recordedBy"] = "Kvotheen-Hyjal",
["typeInfo"] = {
["player"] = {
["name"] = "Torundo the Grizzled",
},
["event"] = "CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY",
["type"] = "MONSTER_SAY",
},
["color"] = {
["r"] = 1,
["g"] = 1,
["b"] = 0.6235294342041016,
},
["text"] = "Torundo the Grizzled says: Not many Amani made it back here.",
["timestamp"] = 1772289270,
["id"] = "s0_4274",
},
{
["recordedBy"] = "Kvotheen-Hyjal",
["typeInfo"] = {
["player"] = {
["name"] = "Lilaju",
},
["event"] = "CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY",
["type"] = "MONSTER_SAY",
},
["color"] = {
["r"] = 1,
["g"] = 1,
["b"] = 0.6235294342041016,
},
["text"] = "Lilaju says: De Revantusk also suffered heavy losses.",
["timestamp"] = 1772289273,
["id"] = "s0_4275",
},
{
["recordedBy"] = "Kvotheen-Hyjal",
["typeInfo"] = {
["player"] = {
["name"] = "Tak'lejo",
},
["event"] = "CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY",
["type"] = "MONSTER_SAY",
},
["color"] = {
["r"] = 1,
["g"] = 1,
["b"] = 0.6235294342041016,
},
["text"] = "Tak'lejo says: I have sent out a call to my people. We will see.",
["timestamp"] = 1772289277,
["id"] = "s0_4276",
},
{
["recordedBy"] = "Kvotheen-Hyjal",
["typeInfo"] = {
["player"] = {
["name"] = "Lady Liadrin",
},
["event"] = "CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY",
["type"] = "MONSTER_SAY",
},
["color"] = {
["r"] = 1,
["g"] = 1,
["b"] = 0.6235294342041016,
},
["text"] = "Lady Liadrin says: Forgive me...",
["timestamp"] = 1772289281,
["id"] = "s0_4277",
},
{
["recordedBy"] = "Kvotheen-Hyjal",
["typeInfo"] = {
["player"] = {
["name"] = "Lady Liadrin",
},
["event"] = "CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY",
["type"] = "MONSTER_SAY",
},
["color"] = {
["r"] = 1,
["g"] = 1,
["b"] = 0.6235294342041016,
},
["text"] = "Lady Liadrin says: But what about the loa? Can you not call upon them to aid you?",
["timestamp"] = 1772289282,
["id"] = "s0_4278",
},
{
["recordedBy"] = "Kvotheen-Hyjal",
["typeInfo"] = {
["player"] = {
["name"] = "Torundo the Grizzled",
},
["event"] = "CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY",
["type"] = "MONSTER_SAY",
},
["color"] = {
["r"] = 1,
["g"] = 1,
["b"] = 0.6235294342041016,
},
["text"] = "Torundo the Grizzled says: De loa? Dey abandoned us long ago.",
["timestamp"] = 1772289286,
["id"] = "s0_4279",
},
{
["recordedBy"] = "Kvotheen-Hyjal",
["typeInfo"] = {
["player"] = {
["name"] = "Zul'jan",
},
["event"] = "CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY",
["type"] = "MONSTER_SAY",
},
["color"] = {
["r"] = 1,
["g"] = 1,
["b"] = 0.6235294342041016,
},
["text"] = "Zul'jan says: We never needed them. We can rely on our own strength!",
["timestamp"] = 1772289290,
["id"] = "s0_4280",
},
{
["recordedBy"] = "Kvotheen-Hyjal",
["typeInfo"] = {
["player"] = {
["name"] = "Zul'jarra",
},
["event"] = "CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY",
["type"] = "MONSTER_SAY",
},
["color"] = {
["r"] = 1,
["g"] = 1,
["b"] = 0.6235294342041016,
},
["text"] = "Zul'jarra says: I ask again for your assistance. We've got to make a stand.",
["timestamp"] = 1772289296,
["id"] = "s0_4281",
},
{
["recordedBy"] = "Kvotheen-Hyjal",
["typeInfo"] = {
["player"] = {
["name"] = "Zul'jarra",
},
["event"] = "CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY",
["type"] = "MONSTER_SAY",
},
["color"] = {
["r"] = 1,
["g"] = 1,
["b"] = 0.6235294342041016,
},
["text"] = "Zul'jarra says: Make ready what you can.",
["timestamp"] = 1772289300,
["id"] = "s0_4282",
},
{
["recordedBy"] = "Kvotheen-Hyjal",
["typeInfo"] = {
["player"] = {
["name"] = "Zul'jarra",
},
["event"] = "CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY",
["type"] = "MONSTER_SAY",
},
["color"] = {
["r"] = 1,
["g"] = 1,
["b"] = 0.6235294342041016,
},
["text"] = "Zul'jarra says: No point in talkin' about de loa. Dey abandoned us long ago. Come. Let us check on de refugees.",
["timestamp"] = 1772289334,
["id"] = "s0_4283",
},
{
["recordedBy"] = "Kvotheen-Hyjal",
["typeInfo"] = {
["player"] = {
["name"] = "Small Refugee",
},
["event"] = "CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY",
["type"] = "MONSTER_SAY",
},
["color"] = {
["r"] = 1,
["g"] = 1,
["b"] = 0.6235294342041016,
},
["text"] = "Small Refugee says: Mama! I'm so hungry...",
["timestamp"] = 1772289368,
["id"] = "s0_4284",
},
{
["recordedBy"] = "Kvotheen-Hyjal",
["typeInfo"] = {
["player"] = {
["name"] = "Zul'jarra",
},
["event"] = "CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY",
["type"] = "MONSTER_SAY",
},
["color"] = {
["r"] = 1,
["g"] = 1,
["b"] = 0.6235294342041016,
},
["text"] = "Zul'jarra says: Torundo, I need ya report. When can our soldiers be ready for battle?",
["timestamp"] = 1772289369,
["id"] = "s0_4285",
},
{
["recordedBy"] = "Kvotheen-Hyjal",
["typeInfo"] = {
["player"] = {
["name"] = "Torundo the Grizzled",
},
["event"] = "CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY",
["type"] = "MONSTER_SAY",
},
["color"] = {
["r"] = 1,
["g"] = 1,
["b"] = 0.6235294342041016,
},
["text"] = "Torundo the Grizzled says: It don't look good. All that's left be de old, de injured, and de hungry.",
["timestamp"] = 1772289375,
["id"] = "s0_4286",
},
{
["recordedBy"] = "Kvotheen-Hyjal",
["typeInfo"] = {
["player"] = {
["name"] = "Lady Liadrin",
},
["event"] = "CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY",
["type"] = "MONSTER_SAY",
},
["color"] = {
["r"] = 1,
["g"] = 1,
["b"] = 0.6235294342041016,
},
["text"] = "Lady Liadrin says: Your people's situation is far more desperate than I realized.",
["timestamp"] = 1772289389,
["id"] = "s0_4287",
},
{
["recordedBy"] = "Kvotheen-Hyjal",
["typeInfo"] = {
["player"] = {
["name"] = "Zul'jarra",
},
["event"] = "CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY",
["type"] = "MONSTER_SAY",
},
["color"] = {
["r"] = 1,
["g"] = 1,
["b"] = 0.6235294342041016,
},
["text"] = "Zul'jarra says: De tribes have splintered since Zul'jin fell. De Twilight Blade pickin' us apart because we no longer work as one.",
["timestamp"] = 1772289395,
["id"] = "s0_4288",
},
{
["recordedBy"] = "Kvotheen-Hyjal",
["typeInfo"] = {
["player"] = {
["name"] = "Lilaju",
},
["event"] = "CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY",
["type"] = "MONSTER_SAY",
},
["color"] = {
["r"] = 1,
["g"] = 1,
["b"] = 0.6235294342041016,
},
["text"] = "Lilaju says: De Revantusk's best smiths be repairing our weapons, Zul'jarra.",
["timestamp"] = 1772289411,
["id"] = "s0_4289",
},
{
["recordedBy"] = "Kvotheen-Hyjal",
["typeInfo"] = {
["player"] = {
["name"] = "Lilaju",
},
["event"] = "CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY",
["type"] = "MONSTER_SAY",
},
["color"] = {
["r"] = 1,
["g"] = 1,
["b"] = 0.6235294342041016,
},
["text"] = "Lilaju says: We are workin' as fast as we can. But many of our weapons were broken in de attack.",
["timestamp"] = 1772289423,
["id"] = "s0_4290",
},
{
["recordedBy"] = "Kvotheen-Hyjal",
["typeInfo"] = {
["player"] = {
["name"] = "Zul'jarra",
},
["event"] = "CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY",
["type"] = "MONSTER_SAY",
},
["color"] = {
["r"] = 1,
["g"] = 1,
["b"] = 0.6235294342041016,
},
["text"] = "Zul'jarra says: Keep it up. These weapons are our best chance against de Void.",
["timestamp"] = 1772289430,
["id"] = "s0_4291",
},
{
["recordedBy"] = "Kvotheen-Hyjal",
["typeInfo"] = {
["player"] = {
["name"] = "Zul'jarra",
},
["event"] = "CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY",
["type"] = "MONSTER_SAY",
},
["color"] = {
["r"] = 1,
["g"] = 1,
["b"] = 0.6235294342041016,
},
["text"] = "Zul'jarra says: If de lightwood weapons are not ready, maybe de Shadowpine shamans can help.",
["timestamp"] = 1772289435,
["id"] = "s0_4292",
},
{
["recordedBy"] = "Kvotheen-Hyjal",
["typeInfo"] = {
["player"] = {
["name"] = "Tak'lejo",
},
["event"] = "CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY",
["type"] = "MONSTER_SAY",
},
["color"] = {
["r"] = 1,
["g"] = 1,
["b"] = 0.6235294342041016,
},
["text"] = "Tak'lejo says: Ah, Zul'jarra. You come seeking de power of my tribe's shamans?",
["timestamp"] = 1772289529,
["id"] = "s0_4293",
},
{
["recordedBy"] = "Kvotheen-Hyjal",
["typeInfo"] = {
["player"] = {
["name"] = "Tak'lejo",
},
["event"] = "CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY",
["type"] = "MONSTER_SAY",
},
["color"] = {
["r"] = 1,
["g"] = 1,
["b"] = 0.6235294342041016,
},
["text"] = "Tak'lejo says: You know none can order de Shadowpine. We wander, obeying only de inner fire in each of us.",
["timestamp"] = 1772289541,
["id"] = "s0_4294",
},
{
["recordedBy"] = "Kvotheen-Hyjal",
["typeInfo"] = {
["player"] = {
["name"] = "Zul'jarra",
},
["event"] = "CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY",
["type"] = "MONSTER_SAY",
},
["color"] = {
["r"] = 1,
["g"] = 1,
["b"] = 0.6235294342041016,
},
["text"] = "Zul'jarra says: Then we be left with few warriors, few weapons, and few shamans as well...",
["timestamp"] = 1772289551,
["id"] = "s0_4295",
},
{
["recordedBy"] = "Kvotheen-Hyjal",
["typeInfo"] = {
["player"] = {
["name"] = "Lady Liadrin",
},
["event"] = "CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY",
["type"] = "MONSTER_SAY",
},
["color"] = {
["r"] = 1,
["g"] = 1,
["b"] = 0.6235294342041016,
},
["text"] = "Lady Liadrin says: It is time for desperate acts. Would you let your people perish because you did not try every option?",
["timestamp"] = 1772289558,
["id"] = "s0_4296",
},
{
["recordedBy"] = "Kvotheen-Hyjal",
["typeInfo"] = {
["player"] = {
["name"] = "Zul'jarra",
},
["event"] = "CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY",
["type"] = "MONSTER_SAY",
},
["color"] = {
["r"] = 1,
["g"] = 1,
["b"] = 0.6235294342041016,
},
["text"] = "Zul'jarra says: Fool elf, I told you de loa be silent! If you need proof, let de old loa speaker tell you himself!",
["timestamp"] = 1772289567,
["id"] = "s0_4297",
},
{
["recordedBy"] = "Kvotheen-Hyjal",
["typeInfo"] = {
["player"] = {
["name"] = "Sparring Partner",
},
["event"] = "CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY",
["type"] = "MONSTER_SAY",
},
["color"] = {
["r"] = 1,
["g"] = 1,
["b"] = 0.6235294342041016,
},
["text"] = "Sparring Partner says: For Zul'Aman!",
["timestamp"] = 1772289572,
["id"] = "s0_4298",
},
{
["recordedBy"] = "Kvotheen-Hyjal",
["typeInfo"] = {
["player"] = {
["name"] = "Loa Speaker Kinduru",
},
["event"] = "CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY",
["type"] = "MONSTER_SAY",
},
["color"] = {
["r"] = 1,
["g"] = 1,
["b"] = 0.6235294342041016,
},
["text"] = "Loa Speaker Kinduru says: You were with me as a child when I last went to Akil'zon's temple, Zul'jarra. Do you not remember?",
["timestamp"] = 1772289593,
["id"] = "s0_4299",
},
{
["recordedBy"] = "Kvotheen-Hyjal",
["typeInfo"] = {
["player"] = {
["name"] = "Zul'jarra",
},
["event"] = "CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY",
["type"] = "MONSTER_SAY",
},
["color"] = {
["r"] = 1,
["g"] = 1,
["b"] = 0.6235294342041016,
},
["text"] = "Zul'jarra says: Yes, uncle. But even den de loa did not speak to us.",
["timestamp"] = 1772289602,
["id"] = "s0_4300",
},
{
["recordedBy"] = "Kvotheen-Hyjal",
["typeInfo"] = {
["player"] = {
["name"] = "Loa Speaker Kinduru",
},
["event"] = "CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY",
["type"] = "MONSTER_SAY",
},
["color"] = {
["r"] = 1,
["g"] = 1,
["b"] = 0.6235294342041016,
},
["text"] = "Loa Speaker Kinduru says: De loa always heed us in times of crisis. Dey may listen now to de right voice--someone on de path of de hash'ey!",
["timestamp"] = 1772289680,
["id"] = "s0_4301",
},
{
["recordedBy"] = "Kvotheen-Hyjal",
["typeInfo"] = {
["player"] = {
["name"] = "Loa Speaker Kinduru",
},
["event"] = "CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY",
["type"] = "MONSTER_SAY",
},
["color"] = {
["r"] = 1,
["g"] = 1,
["b"] = 0.6235294342041016,
},
["text"] = "Loa Speaker Kinduru says: Light de shrines on your way to de temple. And don't forget to leave Akil'zon an offerin'!",
["timestamp"] = 1772289723,
["id"] = "s0_4302",
},
{
["recordedBy"] = "Kvotheen-Hyjal",
["typeInfo"] = {
["player"] = {
["name"] = "Zul'jarra",
},
["event"] = "CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY",
["type"] = "MONSTER_SAY",
},
["color"] = {
["r"] = 1,
["g"] = 1,
["b"] = 0.6235294342041016,
},
["text"] = "Zul'jarra says: De temple be overrun with gnarldin. Killin' dem will help us pass de time on de way. Come, \"hash'ura.\"",
["timestamp"] = 1772289730,
["id"] = "s0_4303",
},
{
["recordedBy"] = "Kvotheen-Hyjal",
["typeInfo"] = {
["player"] = {
["name"] = "Recruit Dar'rak",
},
["event"] = "CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY",
["type"] = "MONSTER_SAY",
},
["color"] = {
["r"] = 1,
["g"] = 1,
["b"] = 0.6235294342041016,
},
["text"] = "Recruit Dar'rak says: Anyone willin' to punch me? Rough me up a little? Anyone?",
["timestamp"] = 1772289738,
["id"] = "s0_4304",
},
{
["recordedBy"] = "Kvotheen-Hyjal",
["typeInfo"] = {
["player"] = {
["name"] = "Recruit Dar'rak",
},
["event"] = "CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY",
["type"] = "MONSTER_SAY",
},
["color"] = {
["r"] = 1,
["g"] = 1,
["b"] = 0.6235294342041016,
},
["text"] = "Recruit Dar'rak says: I'll meet you upstairs with my commander. Hope you're as strong as you look!",
["timestamp"] = 1772289754,
["id"] = "s0_4305",
},
{
["recordedBy"] = "Kvotheen-Hyjal",
["typeInfo"] = {
["player"] = {
["name"] = "Zul'jarra",
},
["event"] = "CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY",
["type"] = "MONSTER_SAY",
},
["color"] = {
["r"] = 1,
["g"] = 1,
["b"] = 0.6235294342041016,
},
["text"] = "Zul'jarra says: Uncle, de loa haven't spoken to you in years. Why you think dey will speak to us now?",
["timestamp"] = 1772289765,
["id"] = "s0_4306",
},
{
["recordedBy"] = "Kvotheen-Hyjal",
["typeInfo"] = {
["player"] = {
["name"] = "Loa Speaker Kinduru",
},
["event"] = "CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY",
["type"] = "MONSTER_SAY",
},
["color"] = {
["r"] = 1,
["g"] = 1,
["b"] = 0.6235294342041016,
},
["text"] = "Loa Speaker Kinduru says: You did not know de world with de loa in it, my child. Dey were our strength. Our hope.",
["timestamp"] = 1772289773,
["id"] = "s0_4307",
},
{
["recordedBy"] = "Kvotheen-Hyjal",
["typeInfo"] = {
["player"] = {
["name"] = "Loa Speaker Kinduru",
},
["event"] = "CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY",
["type"] = "MONSTER_SAY",
},
["color"] = {
["r"] = 1,
["g"] = 1,
["b"] = 0.6235294342041016,
},
["text"] = "Loa Speaker Kinduru says: Akil'zon bestowed on me a great honor when she made me her speaker.",
["timestamp"] = 1772289783,
["id"] = "s0_4308",
},
{
["recordedBy"] = "Kvotheen-Hyjal",
["typeInfo"] = {
["player"] = {
["name"] = "Loa Speaker Kinduru",
},
["event"] = "CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY",
["type"] = "MONSTER_SAY",
},
["color"] = {
["r"] = 1,
["g"] = 1,
["b"] = 0.6235294342041016,
},
["text"] = "Loa Speaker Kinduru says: I tried to instill in de both of you--you and Zul'jan--a love for de loa.",
["timestamp"] = 1772289790,
["id"] = "s0_4309",
},
{
["recordedBy"] = "Kvotheen-Hyjal",
["typeInfo"] = {
["player"] = {
["name"] = "Zul'jarra",
},
["event"] = "CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY",
["type"] = "MONSTER_SAY",
},
["color"] = {
["r"] = 1,
["g"] = 1,
["b"] = 0.6235294342041016,
},
["text"] = "Zul'jarra says: I remember de stories about Akil'zon, Halazzi, Jan'alai, and Nalorakk, and how dey protected us.",
["timestamp"] = 1772289800,
["id"] = "s0_4310",
},
{
["recordedBy"] = "Kvotheen-Hyjal",
["typeInfo"] = {
["player"] = {
["name"] = "Zul'jarra",
},
["event"] = "CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY",
["type"] = "MONSTER_SAY",
},
["color"] = {
["r"] = 1,
["g"] = 1,
["b"] = 0.6235294342041016,
},
["text"] = "Zul'jarra says: I loved listenin' to your stories, uncle. But even then I wondered if they were true.",
["timestamp"] = 1772289809,
["id"] = "s0_4311",
},
{
["recordedBy"] = "Kvotheen-Hyjal",
["typeInfo"] = {
["player"] = {
["name"] = "Loa Speaker Kinduru",
},
["event"] = "CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY",
["type"] = "MONSTER_SAY",
},
["color"] = {
["r"] = 1,
["g"] = 1,
["b"] = 0.6235294342041016,
},
["text"] = "Loa Speaker Kinduru says: How much do you remember about goin' to Akil'zon's temple?",
["timestamp"] = 1772289816,
["id"] = "s0_4312",
},
{
["recordedBy"] = "Kvotheen-Hyjal",
["typeInfo"] = {
["player"] = {
["name"] = "Zul'jarra",
},
["event"] = "CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY",
["type"] = "MONSTER_SAY",
},
["color"] = {
["r"] = 1,
["g"] = 1,
["b"] = 0.6235294342041016,
},
["text"] = "Zul'jarra says: We climbed to de temple. Zul'jan fell. I did not get de loa's blessin'. And my mother died.",
["timestamp"] = 1772289822,
["id"] = "s0_4313",
},
{
["recordedBy"] = "Kvotheen-Hyjal",
["typeInfo"] = {
["player"] = {
["name"] = "Loa Speaker Kinduru",
},
["event"] = "CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY",
["type"] = "MONSTER_SAY",
},
["color"] = {
["r"] = 1,
["g"] = 1,
["b"] = 0.6235294342041016,
},
["text"] = "Loa Speaker Kinduru says: You saved your brother. And you defended your right to lead as Zul'jin's granddaughter--all on your own.",
["timestamp"] = 1772289831,
["id"] = "s0_4314",
},
{
["recordedBy"] = "Kvotheen-Hyjal",
["typeInfo"] = {
["player"] = {
["name"] = "Loa Speaker Kinduru",
},
["event"] = "CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY",
["type"] = "MONSTER_SAY",
},
["color"] = {
["r"] = 1,
["g"] = 1,
["b"] = 0.6235294342041016,
},
["text"] = "Loa Speaker Kinduru says: If anyone can get to de loa and get answers, it is you.",
["timestamp"] = 1772289838,
["id"] = "s0_4315",
},
{
["recordedBy"] = "Kvotheen-Hyjal",
["typeInfo"] = {
["player"] = {
["name"] = "Zul'jarra",
},
["event"] = "CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY",
["type"] = "MONSTER_SAY",
},
["color"] = {
["r"] = 1,
["g"] = 1,
["b"] = 0.6235294342041016,
},
["text"] = "Zul'jarra says: As de \"hash'ey?\" I'm no priestess. No mystic or uniter.",
["timestamp"] = 1772289844,
["id"] = "s0_4316",
},
{
["recordedBy"] = "Kvotheen-Hyjal",
["typeInfo"] = {
["player"] = {
["name"] = "Loa Speaker Kinduru",
},
["event"] = "CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY",
["type"] = "MONSTER_SAY",
},
["color"] = {
["r"] = 1,
["g"] = 1,
["b"] = 0.6235294342041016,
},
["text"] = "Loa Speaker Kinduru says: No, my Jarra. As my niece. Because I know you have de fire. And I love you more than anythin'.",
["timestamp"] = 1772289850,
["id"] = "s0_4317",
},
{
["recordedBy"] = "Kvotheen-Hyjal",
["typeInfo"] = {
["player"] = {
["name"] = "Zul'jarra",
},
["event"] = "CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY",
["type"] = "MONSTER_SAY",
},
["color"] = {
["r"] = 1,
["g"] = 1,
["b"] = 0.6235294342041016,
},
["text"] = "Zul'jarra says: Den I will go. For our people and for you, uncle.",
["timestamp"] = 1772289860,
["id"] = "s0_4318",
},
{
["recordedBy"] = "Kvotheen-Hyjal",
["typeInfo"] = {
["player"] = {
["name"] = "Recruit Dar'rak",
},
["event"] = "CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY",
["type"] = "MONSTER_SAY",
},
["color"] = {
["r"] = 1,
["g"] = 1,
["b"] = 0.6235294342041016,
},
["text"] = "Recruit Dar'rak says: For Zul'Aman!",
["timestamp"] = 1772289892,
["id"] = "s0_4319",
},
{
["recordedBy"] = "Kvotheen-Hyjal",
["typeInfo"] = {
["player"] = {
["name"] = "Ri'kari",
},
["event"] = "CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY",
["type"] = "MONSTER_SAY",
},
["color"] = {
["r"] = 1,
["g"] = 1,
["b"] = 0.6235294342041016,
},
["text"] = "Ri'kari says: Dar'rak, show me what you can do! Kvotheen, no holding back!",
["timestamp"] = 1772289892,
["id"] = "s0_4320",
},
{
["recordedBy"] = "Kvotheen-Hyjal",
["typeInfo"] = {
["player"] = {
["name"] = "Ri'kari",
},
["event"] = "CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY",
["type"] = "MONSTER_SAY",
},
["color"] = {
["r"] = 1,
["g"] = 1,
["b"] = 0.6235294342041016,
},
["text"] = "Ri'kari says: Enough. Well done, both of you.",
["timestamp"] = 1772289899,
["id"] = "s0_4321",
},
{
["recordedBy"] = "Kvotheen-Hyjal",
["typeInfo"] = {
["player"] = {
["name"] = "Recruit Dar'rak",
},
["event"] = "CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY",
["type"] = "MONSTER_SAY",
},
["color"] = {
["r"] = 1,
["g"] = 1,
["b"] = 0.6235294342041016,
},
["text"] = "Recruit Dar'rak says: Whoa, you're amazing! Round two once my nose stops bleedin'?",
["timestamp"] = 1772289900,
["id"] = "s0_4322",
},
{
["recordedBy"] = "Kvotheen-Hyjal",
["typeInfo"] = {
["player"] = {
["name"] = "Ri'kari",
},
["event"] = "CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY",
["type"] = "MONSTER_SAY",
},
["color"] = {
["r"] = 1,
["g"] = 1,
["b"] = 0.6235294342041016,
},
["text"] = "Ri'kari says: Dar'rak, you've impressed me. Congratulations, soldier.",
["timestamp"] = 1772289913,
["id"] = "s0_4323",
},
{
["recordedBy"] = "Kvotheen-Hyjal",
["typeInfo"] = {
["player"] = {
["name"] = "Recruit Dar'rak",
},
["event"] = "CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY",
["type"] = "MONSTER_SAY",
},
["color"] = {
["r"] = 1,
["g"] = 1,
["b"] = 0.6235294342041016,
},
["text"] = "Recruit Dar'rak says: I DID IT! I mean, thank you, Ri'kari. You've been a great teacher.",
["timestamp"] = 1772289917,
["id"] = "s0_4324",
},
{
["recordedBy"] = "Kvotheen-Hyjal",
["typeInfo"] = {
["player"] = {
["name"] = "Chana",
},
["event"] = "CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY",
["type"] = "MONSTER_SAY",
},
["color"] = {
["r"] = 1,
["g"] = 1,
["b"] = 0.6235294342041016,
},
["text"] = "Chana says: Thank you, Kvotheen. I don't wanna do this on my own.",
["timestamp"] = 1772289969,
["id"] = "s0_4325",
},
{
["recordedBy"] = "Kvotheen-Hyjal",
["typeInfo"] = {
["player"] = {
["name"] = "Chana",
},
["event"] = "CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY",
["type"] = "MONSTER_SAY",
},
["color"] = {
["r"] = 1,
["g"] = 1,
["b"] = 0.6235294342041016,
},
["text"] = "Chana says: I'll meet you in de Solemn Valley, across the river.",
["timestamp"] = 1772289974,
["id"] = "s0_4326",
},
{
["recordedBy"] = "Kvotheen-Hyjal",
["typeInfo"] = {
["player"] = {
["name"] = "Ani",
},
["event"] = "CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY",
["type"] = "MONSTER_SAY",
},
["color"] = {
["r"] = 1,
["g"] = 1,
["b"] = 0.6235294342041016,
},
["text"] = "Ani says: Yum! Is that grilled scalebiter?",
["timestamp"] = 1772289990,
["id"] = "s0_4327",
},
{
["recordedBy"] = "Kvotheen-Hyjal",
["typeInfo"] = {
["player"] = {
["name"] = "Gijaniji",
},
["event"] = "CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY",
["type"] = "MONSTER_SAY",
},
["color"] = {
["r"] = 1,
["g"] = 1,
["b"] = 0.6235294342041016,
},
["text"] = "Gijaniji says: Don't worry, Ani. I'll set some aside for you.",
["timestamp"] = 1772289993,
["id"] = "s0_4328",
},
{
["recordedBy"] = "Kvotheen-Hyjal",
["typeInfo"] = {
["player"] = {
["name"] = "Ani",
},
["event"] = "CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY",
["type"] = "MONSTER_SAY",
},
["color"] = {
["r"] = 1,
["g"] = 1,
["b"] = 0.6235294342041016,
},
["text"] = "Ani says: Thanks, Gijaniji! Come on, Jynx.",
["timestamp"] = 1772289995,
["id"] = "s0_4329",
},
{
["recordedBy"] = "Kvotheen-Hyjal",
["typeInfo"] = {
["player"] = {
["name"] = "Unknown",
},
["event"] = "CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY",
["type"] = "MONSTER_SAY",
},
["color"] = {
["r"] = 1,
["g"] = 1,
["b"] = 0.6235294342041016,
},
["text"] = "Unknown says: Brother, is dat you?",
["timestamp"] = 1772290026,
["id"] = "s0_4330",
},
{
["recordedBy"] = "Kvotheen-Hyjal",
["typeInfo"] = {
["player"] = {
["name"] = "Iz'ken",
},
["event"] = "CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY",
["type"] = "MONSTER_SAY",
},
["color"] = {
["r"] = 1,
["g"] = 1,
["b"] = 0.6235294342041016,
},
["text"] = "Iz'ken says: I heard mother died. Who is dis Zandalari?",
["timestamp"] = 1772290028,
["id"] = "s0_4331",
},
{
["recordedBy"] = "Kvotheen-Hyjal",
["typeInfo"] = {
["player"] = {
["name"] = "Chana",
},
["event"] = "CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY",
["type"] = "MONSTER_SAY",
},
["color"] = {
["r"] = 1,
["g"] = 1,
["b"] = 0.6235294342041016,
},
["text"] = "Chana says: I didn't think you'd show up. Dey came to help with de ceremony.",
["timestamp"] = 1772290031,
["id"] = "s0_4332",
},
{
["recordedBy"] = "Kvotheen-Hyjal",
["typeInfo"] = {
["player"] = {
["name"] = "Iz'ken",
},
["event"] = "CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY",
["type"] = "MONSTER_SAY",
},
["color"] = {
["r"] = 1,
["g"] = 1,
["b"] = 0.6235294342041016,
},
["text"] = "Iz'ken says: To help, or to make sure we play nice and don' kill each other?",
["timestamp"] = 1772290035,
["id"] = "s0_4333",
},
{
["recordedBy"] = "Kvotheen-Hyjal",
["typeInfo"] = {
["player"] = {
["name"] = "Jak'zari",
},
["event"] = "CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY",
["type"] = "MONSTER_SAY",
},
["color"] = {
["r"] = 1,
["g"] = 1,
["b"] = 0.6235294342041016,
},
["text"] = "Jak'zari says: You have a moment to spare, outsider? Some friends could use a hand!",
["timestamp"] = 1772290058,
["id"] = "s0_4334",
},
{
["recordedBy"] = "Kvotheen-Hyjal",
["typeInfo"] = {
["player"] = {
["name"] = "Jak'zari",
},
["event"] = "CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY",
["type"] = "MONSTER_SAY",
},
["color"] = {
["r"] = 1,
["g"] = 1,
["b"] = 0.6235294342041016,
},
["text"] = "Jak'zari says: Kahanea's new to her job, so she'll need all de help she can get!",
["timestamp"] = 1772290079,
["id"] = "s0_4335",
},
{
["recordedBy"] = "Kvotheen-Hyjal",
["typeInfo"] = {
["player"] = {
["class"] = "SHAMAN",
["race"] = "ZandalariTroll",
["name"] = "Kvotheen-Hyjal",
["sex"] = 2,
},
["event"] = "CHAT_MSG_LOOT",
["type"] = "LOOT",
},
["color"] = {
["r"] = 0,
["g"] = 0.6666666865348816,
["b"] = 0,
},
["text"] = "You receive loot: |cnIQ1:|Hitem:239447::::::::84:263:::::::::|h[Weeping Spores]|h|rx5",
["timestamp"] = 1772290086,
["id"] = "s0_4336",
},
{
["recordedBy"] = "Kvotheen-Hyjal",
["typeInfo"] = {
["player"] = {
["name"] = "Chana",
},
["event"] = "CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY",
["type"] = "MONSTER_SAY",
},
["color"] = {
["r"] = 1,
["g"] = 1,
["b"] = 0.6235294342041016,
},
["text"] = "Chana says: Iz'ken, be careful pickin' de spores. You don't wanna anger de boars.",
["timestamp"] = 1772290086,
["id"] = "s0_4337",
},
{
["recordedBy"] = "Kvotheen-Hyjal",
["typeInfo"] = {
["player"] = {
["name"] = "Iz'ken",
},
["event"] = "CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY",
["type"] = "MONSTER_SAY",
},
["color"] = {
["r"] = 1,
["g"] = 1,
["b"] = 0.6235294342041016,
},
["text"] = "Iz'ken says: I see some things never change.",
["timestamp"] = 1772290090,
["id"] = "s0_4338",
},
{
["recordedBy"] = "Kvotheen-Hyjal",
["typeInfo"] = {
["player"] = {
["name"] = "Iz'ken",
},
["event"] = "CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY",
["type"] = "MONSTER_SAY",
},
["color"] = {
["r"] = 1,
["g"] = 1,
["b"] = 0.6235294342041016,
},
["text"] = "Iz'ken says: Mother never gave me de chance to make mistakes.",
["timestamp"] = 1772290095,
["id"] = "s0_4339",
},
{
["recordedBy"] = "Kvotheen-Hyjal",
["typeInfo"] = {
["player"] = {
["name"] = "Iz'ken",
},
["event"] = "CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY",
["type"] = "MONSTER_SAY",
},
["color"] = {
["r"] = 1,
["g"] = 1,
["b"] = 0.6235294342041016,
},
["text"] = "Iz'ken says: Neither did you.",
["timestamp"] = 1772290097,
["id"] = "s0_4340",
},
{
["recordedBy"] = "Kvotheen-Hyjal",
["typeInfo"] = {
["player"] = {
["class"] = "SHAMAN",
["race"] = "ZandalariTroll",
