},
["color"] = {
["r"] = 1,
["g"] = 1,
["b"] = 0.6235294342041016,
},
["text"] = "Akil'zon says: Next you must seek Halazzi's blessing. He is hidden, but his speaker can help you find him.",
["timestamp"] = 1772294603,
["id"] = "s0_4694",
},
{
["recordedBy"] = "Kvotheen-Hyjal",
["typeInfo"] = {
["player"] = {
["name"] = "Zul'jarra",
},
["event"] = "CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY",
["type"] = "MONSTER_SAY",
},
["color"] = {
["r"] = 1,
["g"] = 1,
["b"] = 0.6235294342041016,
},
["text"] = "Zul'jarra says: De Witherbark loa speakers are dead. But maybe Kul'amara can help.",
["timestamp"] = 1772294614,
["id"] = "s0_4695",
},
{
["recordedBy"] = "Kvotheen-Hyjal",
["typeInfo"] = {
["player"] = {
["name"] = "Lady Liadrin",
},
["event"] = "CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY",
["type"] = "MONSTER_SAY",
},
["color"] = {
["r"] = 1,
["g"] = 1,
["b"] = 0.6235294342041016,
},
["text"] = "Lady Liadrin says: You seem... pensive, Zul'jarra. Are you not relieved Akil'zon graced us with her favor?",
["timestamp"] = 1772294648,
["id"] = "s0_4696",
},
{
["recordedBy"] = "Kvotheen-Hyjal",
["typeInfo"] = {
["player"] = {
["name"] = "Zul'jarra",
},
["event"] = "CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY",
["type"] = "MONSTER_SAY",
},
["color"] = {
["r"] = 1,
["g"] = 1,
["b"] = 0.6235294342041016,
},
["text"] = "Zul'jarra says: What is dis, elf? You become my hash'ura and you think you can ask me personal questions now?",
["timestamp"] = 1772294656,
["id"] = "s0_4697",
},
{
["recordedBy"] = "Kvotheen-Hyjal",
["typeInfo"] = {
["player"] = {
["name"] = "Lady Liadrin",
},
["event"] = "CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY",
["type"] = "MONSTER_SAY",
},
["color"] = {
["r"] = 1,
["g"] = 1,
["b"] = 0.6235294342041016,
},
["text"] = "Lady Liadrin says: Zul'jarra, I see that something is burdening you. I genuinely want to help.",
["timestamp"] = 1772294662,
["id"] = "s0_4698",
},
{
["recordedBy"] = "Kvotheen-Hyjal",
["typeInfo"] = {
["player"] = {
["name"] = "Zul'jarra",
},
["event"] = "CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY",
["type"] = "MONSTER_SAY",
},
["color"] = {
["r"] = 1,
["g"] = 1,
["b"] = 0.6235294342041016,
},
["text"] = "Zul'jarra says: If I share my feelings, you gonna tell me how to rid myself of de hot rage and cold shame at what Akil'zon told us?",
["timestamp"] = 1772294668,
["id"] = "s0_4699",
},
{
["recordedBy"] = "Kvotheen-Hyjal",
["typeInfo"] = {
["player"] = {
["name"] = "Lady Liadrin",
},
["event"] = "CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY",
["type"] = "MONSTER_SAY",
},
["color"] = {
["r"] = 1,
["g"] = 1,
["b"] = 0.6235294342041016,
},
["text"] = "Lady Liadrin says: About your grandfather, Zul'jin?",
["timestamp"] = 1772294676,
["id"] = "s0_4700",
},
{
["recordedBy"] = "Kvotheen-Hyjal",
["typeInfo"] = {
["player"] = {
["name"] = "Zul'jarra",
},
["event"] = "CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY",
["type"] = "MONSTER_SAY",
},
["color"] = {
["r"] = 1,
["g"] = 1,
["b"] = 0.6235294342041016,
},
["text"] = "Zul'jarra says: Yes. Dat my grandfather's rage made him betray de loa, try to take their power, and cut us off from our gods!",
["timestamp"] = 1772294679,
["id"] = "s0_4701",
},
{
["recordedBy"] = "Kvotheen-Hyjal",
["typeInfo"] = {
["player"] = {
["name"] = "Lady Liadrin",
},
["event"] = "CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY",
["type"] = "MONSTER_SAY",
},
["color"] = {
["r"] = 1,
["g"] = 1,
["b"] = 0.6235294342041016,
},
["text"] = "Lady Liadrin says: Rage is a powerful emotion. My people were once consumed by it as well.",
["timestamp"] = 1772294688,
["id"] = "s0_4702",
},
{
["recordedBy"] = "Kvotheen-Hyjal",
["typeInfo"] = {
["player"] = {
["name"] = "Lady Liadrin",
},
["event"] = "CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY",
["type"] = "MONSTER_SAY",
},
["color"] = {
["r"] = 1,
["g"] = 1,
["b"] = 0.6235294342041016,
},
["text"] = "Lady Liadrin says: I was consumed by rage at Zul'jin for what he did and sought retribution against him for years.",
["timestamp"] = 1772294694,
["id"] = "s0_4703",
},
{
["recordedBy"] = "Kvotheen-Hyjal",
["typeInfo"] = {
["player"] = {
["name"] = "Lady Liadrin",
},
["event"] = "CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY",
["type"] = "MONSTER_SAY",
},
["color"] = {
["r"] = 1,
["g"] = 1,
["b"] = 0.6235294342041016,
},
["text"] = "Lady Liadrin says: Zul'jin, I realized, was the same. He had good reason for his rage. And it festered and controlled him.",
["timestamp"] = 1772294702,
["id"] = "s0_4704",
},
{
["recordedBy"] = "Kvotheen-Hyjal",
["typeInfo"] = {
["player"] = {
["name"] = "Zul'jarra",
},
["event"] = "CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY",
["type"] = "MONSTER_SAY",
},
["color"] = {
["r"] = 1,
["g"] = 1,
["b"] = 0.6235294342041016,
},
["text"] = "Zul'jarra says: Are you saying I should feel sorry for him? Dat he should be pardoned because he had big feelings?",
["timestamp"] = 1772294711,
["id"] = "s0_4705",
},
{
["recordedBy"] = "Kvotheen-Hyjal",
["typeInfo"] = {
["player"] = {
["name"] = "Lady Liadrin",
},
["event"] = "CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY",
["type"] = "MONSTER_SAY",
},
["color"] = {
["r"] = 1,
["g"] = 1,
["b"] = 0.6235294342041016,
},
["text"] = "Lady Liadrin says: No. I'm saying there is a lesson to be learned. Let go of your rage at the loa and at Zul'jin. It will lead you off your path.",
["timestamp"] = 1772294718,
["id"] = "s0_4706",
},
{
["recordedBy"] = "Kvotheen-Hyjal",
["typeInfo"] = {
["player"] = {
["name"] = "Zul'jarra",
},
["event"] = "CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY",
["type"] = "MONSTER_SAY",
},
["color"] = {
["r"] = 1,
["g"] = 1,
["b"] = 0.6235294342041016,
},
["text"] = "Zul'jarra says: Hmph. You have again given me good counsel. And perhaps we are more alike than we seem.",
["timestamp"] = 1772294729,
["id"] = "s0_4707",
},
