},
["color"] = {
["b"] = 0.6235294342041016,
["g"] = 1,
["r"] = 1,
},
["text"] = "Oban says: Maybe just as well she left. She's not like her sister. She's a wild one with no respect for her elders.",
["id"] = "s1_2657",
["timestamp"] = 1772317478,
},
{
["recordedBy"] = "Kvotheen-Hyjal",
["typeInfo"] = {
["player"] = {
["name"] = "Nija Torntusk",
},
["event"] = "CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY",
["type"] = "MONSTER_SAY",
},
["color"] = {
["b"] = 0.6235294342041016,
["g"] = 1,
["r"] = 1,
},
["text"] = "Nija Torntusk says: Do ya know much about de Witherbark, Zandalari?",
["id"] = "s1_2658",
["timestamp"] = 1772317482,
},
{
["recordedBy"] = "Kvotheen-Hyjal",
["typeInfo"] = {
["player"] = {
["name"] = "Nerunda",
},
["event"] = "CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY",
["type"] = "MONSTER_SAY",
},
["color"] = {
["b"] = 0.6235294342041016,
["g"] = 1,
["r"] = 1,
},
["text"] = "Nerunda says: Father! Dat is just how she is. Say dat again about your grandchild, and I pour your hot supper on your head.",
["id"] = "s1_2659",
["timestamp"] = 1772317485,
},
{
["recordedBy"] = "Kvotheen-Hyjal",
["typeInfo"] = {
["player"] = {
["name"] = "Nija Torntusk",
},
["event"] = "CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY",
["type"] = "MONSTER_SAY",
},
["color"] = {
["b"] = 0.6235294342041016,
["g"] = 1,
["r"] = 1,
},
["text"] = "Nija Torntusk says: I've heard some of dem talkin' about their Hinterlands brethren in de huts. These walls are thin. While ya search, just keep your ears open for mentions of Shadra.",
["id"] = "s1_2660",
["timestamp"] = 1772317584,
},
{
["recordedBy"] = "Kvotheen-Hyjal",
["typeInfo"] = {
["player"] = {
["name"] = "Rajom Swiftspear",
},
["event"] = "CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY",
["type"] = "MONSTER_SAY",
},
["color"] = {
["b"] = 0.6235294342041016,
["g"] = 1,
["r"] = 1,
},
["text"] = "Rajom Swiftspear says: Don't touch my huntin' spears unless you're seekin' a lesson on 'em. Dey are tipped in poison from Skulk Rock.",
["id"] = "s1_2661",
["timestamp"] = 1772317605,
},
{
["recordedBy"] = "Kvotheen-Hyjal",
["typeInfo"] = {
["player"] = {
["name"] = "Haz'kel",
},
["event"] = "CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY",
["type"] = "MONSTER_SAY",
},
["color"] = {
["b"] = 0.6235294342041016,
["g"] = 1,
["r"] = 1,
},
["text"] = "Haz'kel says: Kanza? I saw her runnin' toward de wood bridge where we all play.",
["id"] = "s1_2662",
["timestamp"] = 1772317630,
},
{
["recordedBy"] = "Kvotheen-Hyjal",
["typeInfo"] = {
["player"] = {
["name"] = "Haz'kel",
},
["event"] = "CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY",
["type"] = "MONSTER_SAY",
},
["color"] = {
["b"] = 0.6235294342041016,
["g"] = 1,
["r"] = 1,
},
["text"] = "Haz'kel says: Good luck findin' her. If you do, she'll growl at you. Or just run away again!",
["id"] = "s1_2663",
["timestamp"] = 1772317634,
},
{
["recordedBy"] = "Kvotheen-Hyjal",
["typeInfo"] = {
["player"] = {
["name"] = "Headhunter Og'beh",
},
["event"] = "CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY",
["type"] = "MONSTER_SAY",
},
["color"] = {
["b"] = 0.6235294342041016,
["g"] = 1,
["r"] = 1,
},
["text"] = "Headhunter Og'beh says: Admirin' my trophy? Wilderhammer dwarves foolishly attacked our villages. I brought it with me from de south to Zul'Aman!",
["id"] = "s1_2664",
["timestamp"] = 1772317655,
},
{
["recordedBy"] = "Kvotheen-Hyjal",
["typeInfo"] = {
["player"] = {
["name"] = "Mixer Jamanga",
},
["event"] = "CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY",
["type"] = "MONSTER_SAY",
},
["color"] = {
["b"] = 0.6235294342041016,
["g"] = 1,
["r"] = 1,
},
["text"] = "Mixer Jamanga says: When we fled de Hinterlands, I brought some of de recipes and relics of Zun'watha with me, but de ingredients are very different here.",
["id"] = "s1_2665",
["timestamp"] = 1772317690,
},
{
["recordedBy"] = "Kvotheen-Hyjal",
["typeInfo"] = {
["player"] = {
["name"] = "Nija Torntusk",
},
["event"] = "CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY",
["type"] = "MONSTER_SAY",
},
["color"] = {
["b"] = 0.6235294342041016,
["g"] = 1,
["r"] = 1,
},
["text"] = "Nija Torntusk says: Halazzi is de Loa of de Hunt, and Shadra is his rival. Huntin' for Shadra might appeal to him.",
["id"] = "s1_2666",
["timestamp"] = 1772317766,
},
{
["recordedBy"] = "Kvotheen-Hyjal",
["typeInfo"] = {
["player"] = {
["name"] = "Halazzi",
},
["event"] = "CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY",
["type"] = "MONSTER_SAY",
},
["color"] = {
["b"] = 0.6235294342041016,
["g"] = 1,
["r"] = 1,
},
["text"] = "Halazzi says: Ah, a request to see the invisible... an interesting hunt is ahead of you.",
["id"] = "s1_2667",
["timestamp"] = 1772317779,
},
{
["recordedBy"] = "Kvotheen-Hyjal",
["typeInfo"] = {
