["id"] = "s1_2838",
},
{
["recordedBy"] = "Kvotheen-Hyjal",
["typeInfo"] = {
["player"] = {
["name"] = "Witherbark Visitor",
},
["event"] = "CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY",
["type"] = "MONSTER_SAY",
},
["color"] = {
["r"] = 1,
["g"] = 1,
["b"] = 0.6235294342041016,
},
["text"] = "Witherbark Visitor says: De heat of summer was at its peak when...",
["timestamp"] = 1772323165,
["id"] = "s1_2839",
},
{
["recordedBy"] = "Kvotheen-Hyjal",
["typeInfo"] = {
["player"] = {
["name"] = "Witherbark Visitor",
},
["event"] = "CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY",
["type"] = "MONSTER_SAY",
},
["color"] = {
["r"] = 1,
["g"] = 1,
["b"] = 0.6235294342041016,
},
["text"] = "Witherbark Visitor says: A raging dragonhawk rained chaos down on de village.",
["timestamp"] = 1772323167,
["id"] = "s1_2840",
},
{
["recordedBy"] = "Kvotheen-Hyjal",
["typeInfo"] = {
["player"] = {
["name"] = "Witherbark Visitor",
},
["event"] = "CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY",
["type"] = "MONSTER_SAY",
},
["color"] = {
["r"] = 1,
["g"] = 1,
["b"] = 0.6235294342041016,
},
["text"] = "Witherbark Visitor says: De Witherbark defended their home proudly.",
["timestamp"] = 1772323173,
["id"] = "s1_2841",
},
{
["recordedBy"] = "Kvotheen-Hyjal",
["typeInfo"] = {
["player"] = {
["name"] = "Witherbark Visitor",
},
["event"] = "CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY",
["type"] = "MONSTER_SAY",
},
["color"] = {
["r"] = 1,
["g"] = 1,
["b"] = 0.6235294342041016,
},
["text"] = "Witherbark Visitor says: A dense mist had covered de forest...",
["timestamp"] = 1772323183,
["id"] = "s1_2842",
},
{
["recordedBy"] = "Kvotheen-Hyjal",
["typeInfo"] = {
["player"] = {
["name"] = "Witherbark Visitor",
},
["event"] = "CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY",
["type"] = "MONSTER_SAY",
},
["color"] = {
["r"] = 1,
["g"] = 1,
["b"] = 0.6235294342041016,
},
["text"] = "Witherbark Visitor says: Elven assassins descended upon de Witherbark.",
["timestamp"] = 1772323186,
["id"] = "s1_2843",
},
{
["recordedBy"] = "Kvotheen-Hyjal",
["typeInfo"] = {
["player"] = {
["name"] = "Witherbark Visitor",
},
["event"] = "CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY",
["type"] = "MONSTER_SAY",
},
["color"] = {
["r"] = 1,
["g"] = 1,
["b"] = 0.6235294342041016,
},
["text"] = "Witherbark Visitor says: A lone Witherbark warrior won de day.",
["timestamp"] = 1772323192,
["id"] = "s1_2844",
},
{
["recordedBy"] = "Kvotheen-Hyjal",
["typeInfo"] = {
["player"] = {
["name"] = "Witherbark Visitor",
},
["event"] = "CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY",
["type"] = "MONSTER_SAY",
},
["color"] = {
["r"] = 1,
["g"] = 1,
["b"] = 0.6235294342041016,
},
["text"] = "Witherbark Visitor says: A dense mist had covered de forest...",
["timestamp"] = 1772323201,
["id"] = "s1_2845",
},
{
["recordedBy"] = "Kvotheen-Hyjal",
["typeInfo"] = {
["player"] = {
["name"] = "Witherbark Visitor",
},
["event"] = "CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY",
["type"] = "MONSTER_SAY",
},
["color"] = {
["r"] = 1,
["g"] = 1,
["b"] = 0.6235294342041016,
},
["text"] = "Witherbark Visitor says: Countless murlocs besieged de Witherbark!",
["timestamp"] = 1772323202,
["id"] = "s1_2846",
},
{
["recordedBy"] = "Kvotheen-Hyjal",
["typeInfo"] = {
["player"] = {
["name"] = "Witherbark Visitor",
},
["event"] = "CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY",
["type"] = "MONSTER_SAY",
},
["color"] = {
["r"] = 1,
["g"] = 1,
["b"] = 0.6235294342041016,
},
["text"] = "Witherbark Visitor says: It came at great cost, but de Witherbark triumphed.",
["timestamp"] = 1772323206,
["id"] = "s1_2847",
},
{
["recordedBy"] = "Kvotheen-Hyjal",
["typeInfo"] = {
["player"] = {
["name"] = "Witherbark Visitor",
},
["event"] = "CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY",
["type"] = "MONSTER_SAY",
},
["color"] = {
["r"] = 1,
["g"] = 1,
["b"] = 0.6235294342041016,
},
["text"] = "Witherbark Visitor says: There once was a great fire...",
["timestamp"] = 1772323211,
["id"] = "s1_2848",
},
{
["recordedBy"] = "Kvotheen-Hyjal",
["typeInfo"] = {
["player"] = {
["name"] = "Witherbark Visitor",
},
["event"] = "CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY",
["type"] = "MONSTER_SAY",
},
["color"] = {
["r"] = 1,
["g"] = 1,
["b"] = 0.6235294342041016,
},
["text"] = "Witherbark Visitor says: It was in de aftermath of war...",
["timestamp"] = 1772323212,
["id"] = "s1_2849",
},
{
["recordedBy"] = "Kvotheen-Hyjal",
["typeInfo"] = {
["player"] = {
["name"] = "Witherbark Visitor",
},
["event"] = "CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY",
["type"] = "MONSTER_SAY",
},
["color"] = {
["r"] = 1,
["g"] = 1,
["b"] = 0.6235294342041016,
},
["text"] = "Witherbark Visitor says: Countless murlocs besieged de Witherbark!",
["timestamp"] = 1772323214,
["id"] = "s1_2850",
},
{
["recordedBy"] = "Kvotheen-Hyjal",
["typeInfo"] = {
["player"] = {
["name"] = "Witherbark Visitor",
},
["event"] = "CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY",
["type"] = "MONSTER_SAY",
},
["color"] = {
["r"] = 1,
["g"] = 1,
["b"] = 0.6235294342041016,
},
["text"] = "Witherbark Visitor says: A bear de size of a mammoth attacked!",
["timestamp"] = 1772323215,
["id"] = "s1_2851",
},
{
["recordedBy"] = "Kvotheen-Hyjal",
["typeInfo"] = {
["player"] = {
["name"] = "Witherbark Visitor",
},
["event"] = "CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY",
["type"] = "MONSTER_SAY",
},
["color"] = {
["r"] = 1,
["g"] = 1,
["b"] = 0.6235294342041016,
},
["text"] = "Witherbark Visitor says: And no Witherbark can forget dat fateful day.",
["timestamp"] = 1772323215,
["id"] = "s1_2852",
},
{
["recordedBy"] = "Kvotheen-Hyjal",
["typeInfo"] = {
["player"] = {
["name"] = "Witherbark Visitor",
},
["event"] = "CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY",
["type"] = "MONSTER_SAY",
},
["color"] = {
["r"] = 1,
["g"] = 1,
["b"] = 0.6235294342041016,
},
["text"] = "Witherbark Visitor says: De Witherbark were outnumbered, but dat's just how we like it. We survived by de skin of our tusks.",
["timestamp"] = 1772323216,
["id"] = "s1_2853",
},
{
["recordedBy"] = "Kvotheen-Hyjal",
["typeInfo"] = {
["player"] = {
["name"] = "Seeker Crikkash",
},
["event"] = "CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY",
["type"] = "MONSTER_SAY",
},
["color"] = {
["r"] = 1,
["g"] = 1,
["b"] = 0.6235294342041016,
},
["text"] = "Seeker Crikkash says: I'll meet you in Witherbark Village with the pot. I can't wait to see the look on Ren'zen's face when he sees it!",
["timestamp"] = 1772323238,
["id"] = "s1_2854",
},
{
["recordedBy"] = "Kvotheen-Hyjal",
["typeInfo"] = {
["player"] = {
["class"] = "SHAMAN",
["race"] = "ZandalariTroll",
["name"] = "Kvotheen",
["sex"] = 2,
},
["event"] = "CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_EMOTE",
["type"] = "MONSTER_EMOTE",
},
["color"] = {
["r"] = 1,
["g"] = 0.501960813999176,
["b"] = 0.250980406999588,
},
["text"] = "You sense a nearby Skyriding Glyph.",
["timestamp"] = 1772323247,
["id"] = "s1_2855",
},
{
["recordedBy"] = "Kvotheen-Hyjal",
["typeInfo"] = {
["player"] = {
["name"] = "Filo",
},
["event"] = "CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_EMOTE",
["type"] = "MONSTER_EMOTE",
},
["color"] = {
["r"] = 1,
["g"] = 0.501960813999176,
["b"] = 0.250980406999588,
},
["text"] = "Filo titters happily in greeting then tucks into his plate.",
["timestamp"] = 1772323267,
["id"] = "s1_2856",
},
{
["recordedBy"] = "Kvotheen-Hyjal",
["typeInfo"] = {
["player"] = {
["name"] = "Kanza",
},
["event"] = "CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY",
["type"] = "MONSTER_SAY",
},
["color"] = {
["r"] = 1,
["g"] = 1,
["b"] = 0.6235294342041016,
},
["text"] = "Kanza says: Filo...",
["timestamp"] = 1772323271,
["id"] = "s1_2857",
},
{
["recordedBy"] = "Kvotheen-Hyjal",
["typeInfo"] = {
["player"] = {
["name"] = "Kanza",
},
["event"] = "CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY",
["type"] = "MONSTER_SAY",
},
["color"] = {
["r"] = 1,
["g"] = 1,
["b"] = 0.6235294342041016,
},
["text"] = "Kanza says: My sister... with you?",
["timestamp"] = 1772323273,
["id"] = "s1_2858",
},
{
["recordedBy"] = "Kvotheen-Hyjal",
["typeInfo"] = {
["player"] = {
["name"] = "Kanza",
},
["event"] = "CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_EMOTE",
["type"] = "MONSTER_EMOTE",
},
["color"] = {
["r"] = 1,
["g"] = 0.501960813999176,
["b"] = 0.250980406999588,
},
["text"] = "Filo nods slowly, his mouth full of thorncaps.",
["timestamp"] = 1772323275,
["id"] = "s1_2859",
},
{
["recordedBy"] = "Kvotheen-Hyjal",
["typeInfo"] = {
["player"] = {
["name"] = "Janaka",
},
["event"] = "CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_EMOTE",
["type"] = "MONSTER_EMOTE",
},
["color"] = {
["r"] = 1,
["g"] = 0.501960813999176,
["b"] = 0.250980406999588,
},
["text"] = "Janaka smiles warmly when she sees Kanza.",
["timestamp"] = 1772323278,
["id"] = "s1_2860",
},
{
["recordedBy"] = "Kvotheen-Hyjal",
["typeInfo"] = {
["player"] = {
["name"] = "Kanza",
},
["event"] = "CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY",
["type"] = "MONSTER_SAY",
},
["color"] = {
["r"] = 1,
["g"] = 1,
["b"] = 0.6235294342041016,
},
["text"] = "Kanza says: Are you... okay?",
["timestamp"] = 1772323281,
["id"] = "s1_2861",
},
{
["recordedBy"] = "Kvotheen-Hyjal",
["typeInfo"] = {
["player"] = {
["name"] = "Janaka",
},
["event"] = "CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_EMOTE",
["type"] = "MONSTER_EMOTE",
},
["color"] = {
["r"] = 1,
["g"] = 0.501960813999176,
["b"] = 0.250980406999588,
},
["text"] = "Janaka smiles and nods but then puts her hands on her hips.",
["timestamp"] = 1772323283,
["id"] = "s1_2862",
},
{
["recordedBy"] = "Kvotheen-Hyjal",
["typeInfo"] = {
["player"] = {
["name"] = "Kanza",
},
["event"] = "CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY",
["type"] = "MONSTER_SAY",
},
["color"] = {
["r"] = 1,
["g"] = 1,
["b"] = 0.6235294342041016,
},
["text"] = "Kanza says: I know I should talk to mama. But when I use my voice... all I hear is you.",
["timestamp"] = 1772323287,
["id"] = "s1_2863",
},
{
["recordedBy"] = "Kvotheen-Hyjal",
["typeInfo"] = {
["player"] = {
["name"] = "Filo",
},
["event"] = "CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_EMOTE",
["type"] = "MONSTER_EMOTE",
},
["color"] = {
["r"] = 1,
["g"] = 0.501960813999176,
["b"] = 0.250980406999588,
},
["text"] = "Filo yawns and stretches and begins to walk away.",
["timestamp"] = 1772323292,
["id"] = "s1_2864",
},
{
["recordedBy"] = "Kvotheen-Hyjal",
["typeInfo"] = {
["player"] = {
["name"] = "Kanza",
},
["event"] = "CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY",
["type"] = "MONSTER_SAY",
},
["color"] = {
["r"] = 1,
["g"] = 1,
["b"] = 0.6235294342041016,
},
["text"] = "Kanza says: Do you have to go?",
["timestamp"] = 1772323295,
["id"] = "s1_2865",
},
{
["recordedBy"] = "Kvotheen-Hyjal",
["typeInfo"] = {
["player"] = {
["name"] = "Janaka",
},
["event"] = "CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_EMOTE",
["type"] = "MONSTER_EMOTE",
},
["color"] = {
["r"] = 1,
["g"] = 0.501960813999176,
["b"] = 0.250980406999588,
},
["text"] = "Janaka nods and waves at Kanza as she sets off to follow Filo.",
["timestamp"] = 1772323297,
["id"] = "s1_2866",
},
{
["recordedBy"] = "Kvotheen-Hyjal",
["typeInfo"] = {
["player"] = {
["name"] = "Kanza",
},
["event"] = "CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY",
["type"] = "MONSTER_SAY",
},
["color"] = {
["r"] = 1,
["g"] = 1,
["b"] = 0.6235294342041016,
},
["text"] = "Kanza says: Goodbye, sister. I'll see you again... someday.",
["timestamp"] = 1772323301,
["id"] = "s1_2867",
},
{
["recordedBy"] = "Kvotheen-Hyjal",
["typeInfo"] = {
["player"] = {
["name"] = "Loa Speaker Brek",
},
["event"] = "CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY",
["type"] = "MONSTER_SAY",
},
["color"] = {
["r"] = 1,
["g"] = 1,
["b"] = 0.6235294342041016,
},
["text"] = "Loa Speaker Brek says: De livin' flame be gone, burned in many hearts. Purify yaself, an' it will rise!",
["timestamp"] = 1772323401,
["id"] = "s1_2868",
},
{
["recordedBy"] = "Kvotheen-Hyjal",
["typeInfo"] = {
["player"] = {
["name"] = "Loa Speaker Brek",
},
["event"] = "CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY",
["type"] = "MONSTER_SAY",
},
["color"] = {
["r"] = 1,
["g"] = 1,
["b"] = 0.6235294342041016,
},
["text"] = "Loa Speaker Brek says: I see de fire in you, yes. Find more coals, more fire. Renew de livin' flame!",
["timestamp"] = 1772323439,
["id"] = "s1_2869",
},
{
["recordedBy"] = "Kvotheen-Hyjal",
["typeInfo"] = {
["player"] = {
["name"] = "Lady Liadrin",
},
["event"] = "CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY",
["type"] = "MONSTER_SAY",
},
["color"] = {
["r"] = 1,
["g"] = 1,
["b"] = 0.6235294342041016,
},
["text"] = "Lady Liadrin says: Did he just... hand you that fiery coal with his bare hands?",
["timestamp"] = 1772323448,
["id"] = "s1_2870",
},
{
["recordedBy"] = "Kvotheen-Hyjal",
["typeInfo"] = {
["player"] = {
["name"] = "Zul'jarra",
},
["event"] = "CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY",
["type"] = "MONSTER_SAY",
},
["color"] = {
["r"] = 1,
["g"] = 1,
["b"] = 0.6235294342041016,
},
["text"] = "Zul'jarra says: I am glad to gain Halazzi's favor, but bein' here brings me shame.",
["timestamp"] = 1772323459,
["id"] = "s1_2871",
},
{
["recordedBy"] = "Kvotheen-Hyjal",
["typeInfo"] = {
["player"] = {
["name"] = "Lady Liadrin",
},
["event"] = "CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY",
["type"] = "MONSTER_SAY",
},
["color"] = {
["r"] = 1,
["g"] = 1,
["b"] = 0.6235294342041016,
},
["text"] = "Lady Liadrin says: Why? We rescued the Witherbark. You found the hash'ey shrines. And you are now closer to becoming hash'ey.",
["timestamp"] = 1772323465,
["id"] = "s1_2872",
},
{
["recordedBy"] = "Kvotheen-Hyjal",
["typeInfo"] = {
["player"] = {
["name"] = "Zul'jarra",
},
["event"] = "CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY",
["type"] = "MONSTER_SAY",
},
["color"] = {
["r"] = 1,
["g"] = 1,
["b"] = 0.6235294342041016,
},
["text"] = "Zul'jarra says: De Witherbark needed my help. And I did not listen. I was too worried about my own people.",
["timestamp"] = 1772323474,
["id"] = "s1_2873",
},
{
["recordedBy"] = "Kvotheen-Hyjal",
["typeInfo"] = {
["player"] = {
["class"] = "PRIEST",
["race"] = "BloodElf",
["name"] = "Hèlio-Archimonde",
["sex"] = 3,
},
["event"] = "CHAT_MSG_GUILD_ACHIEVEMENT",
["type"] = "GUILD_ACHIEVEMENT",
},
["color"] = {
["r"] = 0.250980406999588,
["g"] = 1,
["b"] = 0.250980406999588,
},
["text"] = "|Hplayer:Hèlio-Archimonde|h[|cffffffffHèlio-Archimonde|r]|h a accompli le haut fait |cffffff00|Hachievement:61212:Player-1302-09C18F6E:1:3:1:26:4294967295:4294967295:4294967295:4294967295|h[Magisters' Terrace]|h|r !",
["timestamp"] = 1772323476,
["id"] = "s1_2874",
},
{
["recordedBy"] = "Kvotheen-Hyjal",
["typeInfo"] = {
["player"] = {
["name"] = "Lady Liadrin",
},
["event"] = "CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY",
["type"] = "MONSTER_SAY",
},
["color"] = {
["r"] = 1,
["g"] = 1,
["b"] = 0.6235294342041016,
},
["text"] = "Lady Liadrin says: Luckily, Halazzi could not help but meddle in Witherbark affairs despite what your grandfather had done.",
["timestamp"] = 1772323481,
["id"] = "s1_2875",
},
{
["recordedBy"] = "Kvotheen-Hyjal",
["typeInfo"] = {
["player"] = {
["name"] = "Zul'jarra",
},
["event"] = "CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY",
["type"] = "MONSTER_SAY",
},
["color"] = {
["r"] = 1,
["g"] = 1,
["b"] = 0.6235294342041016,
},
["text"] = "Zul'jarra says: Halazzi would not let them die. If it came to it, I feel Akil'zon would not have let us die as well.",
["timestamp"] = 1772323488,
["id"] = "s1_2876",
},
{
["recordedBy"] = "Kvotheen-Hyjal",
["typeInfo"] = {
["player"] = {
["name"] = "Lady Liadrin",
},
["event"] = "CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY",
["type"] = "MONSTER_SAY",
},
["color"] = {
["r"] = 1,
["g"] = 1,
["b"] = 0.6235294342041016,
},
["text"] = "Lady Liadrin says: It sounds like your faith in the loa is strengthening.",
["timestamp"] = 1772323496,
["id"] = "s1_2877",
},
{
["recordedBy"] = "Kvotheen-Hyjal",
["typeInfo"] = {
["player"] = {
["name"] = "Zul'jarra",
},
["event"] = "CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY",
["type"] = "MONSTER_SAY",
},
["color"] = {
["r"] = 1,
["g"] = 1,
["b"] = 0.6235294342041016,
},
["text"] = "Zul'jarra says: Maybe. Akil'zon tested my conviction. And Halazzi forced me to use my head and not my fist.",
["timestamp"] = 1772323500,
["id"] = "s1_2878",
},
{
["recordedBy"] = "Kvotheen-Hyjal",
["typeInfo"] = {
["player"] = {
["name"] = "Zul'jarra",
},
["event"] = "CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY",
["type"] = "MONSTER_SAY",
},
["color"] = {
["r"] = 1,
["g"] = 1,
["b"] = 0.6235294342041016,
},
["text"] = "Zul'jarra says: I only wish I had learned these lessons before and been a better leader.",
["timestamp"] = 1772323508,
["id"] = "s1_2879",
},
{
["recordedBy"] = "Kvotheen-Hyjal",
["typeInfo"] = {
["player"] = {
["name"] = "Lady Liadrin",
},
["event"] = "CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY",
["type"] = "MONSTER_SAY",
},
["color"] = {
["r"] = 1,
["g"] = 1,
["b"] = 0.6235294342041016,
},
["text"] = "Lady Liadrin says: You had scant resources. I cannot say I would not have protected my home over others threatened with violence.",
["timestamp"] = 1772323514,
["id"] = "s1_2880",
},
{
["recordedBy"] = "Kvotheen-Hyjal",
["typeInfo"] = {
["player"] = {
["name"] = "Lady Liadrin",
},
["event"] = "CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY",
["type"] = "MONSTER_SAY",
},
["color"] = {
["r"] = 1,
["g"] = 1,
["b"] = 0.6235294342041016,
},
["text"] = "Lady Liadrin says: I have been in your situation. And like your grandfather, I wanted power and took it without caring who I hurt.",
["timestamp"] = 1772323523,
["id"] = "s1_2881",
},
{
["recordedBy"] = "Kvotheen-Hyjal",
["typeInfo"] = {
["player"] = {
["name"] = "Lady Liadrin",
},
["event"] = "CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY",
["type"] = "MONSTER_SAY",
},
["color"] = {
["r"] = 1,
["g"] = 1,
["b"] = 0.6235294342041016,
},
["text"] = "Lady Liadrin says: I am proud to see you not making the mistakes that I or your grandfather made, and that I am part of your journey.",
["timestamp"] = 1772323532,
["id"] = "s1_2882",
},
{
["recordedBy"] = "Kvotheen-Hyjal",
["typeInfo"] = {
["player"] = {
["name"] = "Zul'jarra",
},
["event"] = "CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY",
["type"] = "MONSTER_SAY",
},
["color"] = {
["r"] = 1,
["g"] = 1,
["b"] = 0.6235294342041016,
},
["text"] = "Zul'jarra says: Proud? Of me? Hmph. I would like to say your words mean nothin'.",
["timestamp"] = 1772323541,
["id"] = "s1_2883",
},
{
["recordedBy"] = "Kvotheen-Hyjal",
["typeInfo"] = {
["player"] = {
["name"] = "Zul'jarra",
},
["event"] = "CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY",
["type"] = "MONSTER_SAY",
},
["color"] = {
["r"] = 1,
["g"] = 1,
["b"] = 0.6235294342041016,
},
["text"] = "Zul'jarra says: But as you are one of my hash'ura, I... thank you for your words.",
["timestamp"] = 1772323548,
["id"] = "s1_2884",
},
{
["recordedBy"] = "Kvotheen-Hyjal",
["typeInfo"] = {
["player"] = {
["name"] = "Zul'jarra",
},
["event"] = "CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY",
["type"] = "MONSTER_SAY",
},
["color"] = {
["r"] = 1,
["g"] = 1,
["b"] = 0.6235294342041016,
},
["text"] = "Zul'jarra says: He speaks madness but seems deeply attuned to de loa. Take de coal, Kvotheen, and see if we can start de trial.",
["timestamp"] = 1772323558,
["id"] = "s1_2885",
},
