["color"] = {
["r"] = 1,
["g"] = 0.250980406999588,
["b"] = 0.250980406999588,
},
["text"] = "Zul'jarra yells: With de blessin' of de loa, we will rid Zul'Aman of de Twilight's Blade. For de Amani!",
