42299:Player-1390-0D566A88:1:1:17:26:4294967295:4294967295:4294967295:4294967295|h[Visions of a Shadowed Sun]|h|r!\",\"timestamp\":1768685701,\"id\":\"s0_8\"},{\"recordedBy\":\"Kvotheen-Hyjal\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"class\":\"WARRIOR\",\"race\":\"MagharOrc\",\"name\":\"Kregor-Hyjal\",\"sex\":2},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_ACHIEVEMENT\",\"type\":\"ACHIEVEMENT\"},\"color\":{\"r\":1,\"g\":1,\"b\":0},\"text\":\"|Hplayer:Kregor-Hyjal|h[|cffc69b6dKregor|r]|h has earned the achievement |cffffff00|Hachievement:61498:Player-1390-0D566A88:1:1:17:26:4294967295:4294967295:4294967295:4294967295|h[Ready for Midnight]|h|r!\",\"timestamp\":1768685701,\"id\":\"s0_9\"},{\"recordedBy\":\"Kvotheen-Hyjal\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"name\":\"Mystic Birdhat\"},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY\",\"type\":\"MONSTER_SAY\"},\"color\":{\"b\":0.6235294342041016,\"g\":1,\"r\":1},\"text\":\"Mystic Birdhat says: Shine and rise.\",\"id\":\"s0_10\",\"timestamp\":1768685890},{\"recordedBy\":\"Kvotheen-Hyjal\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"name\":\"Cousin Slowhands\"},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY\",\"type\":\"MONSTER_SAY\"},\"color\":{\"b\":0.6235294342041016,\"g\":1,\"r\":1},\"text\":\"Cousin Slowhands says: Is it dangerous to go alone?\",\"id\":\"s0_11\",\"timestamp\":1768686376},{\"recordedBy\":\"Kvotheen-Hyjal\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"race\":\"Human\",\"class\":\"PALADIN\",\"name\":\"Itashietsu-Hyjal\",\"sex\":2},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_GUILD_ACHIEVEMENT\",\"type\":\"GUILD_ACHIEVEMENT\"},\"color\":{\"b\":0.250980406999588,\"g\":1,\"r\":0.250980406999588},\"text\":\"|Hplayer:Itashietsu-Hyjal|h[|cfff48cbaItashietsu|r]|h a accompli le haut fait |cffffff00|Hachievement:9017:Player-1390-0D5763EC:1:1:17:26:4294967295:4294967295:4294967295:4294967295|h[Water Management]|h|r !\",\"id\":\"s0_12\",\"timestamp\":1768686946},{\"recordedBy\":\"Kvotheen-Hyjal\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"name\":\"Merrix\"},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY\",\"type\":\"MONSTER_SAY\"},\"color\":{\"b\":0.6235294342041016,\"g\":1,\"r\":1},\"text\":\"Merrix says: Even though the Coreway is usable again, there is still plenty of construction work and rubble clearing needed.\",\"id\":\"s0_13\",\"timestamp\":1768932254},{\"recordedBy\":\"Kvotheen-Hyjal\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"name\":\"Lyssabel Dawnpetal\"},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY\",\"type\":\"MONSTER_SAY\"},\"color\":{\"b\":0.6235294342041016,\"g\":1,\"r\":1},\"text\":\"Lyssabel Dawnpetal says: Ah, a prospective homeowner! Welcome to the neighborhood!\",\"id\":\"s0_14\",\"timestamp\":1768932400},{\"recordedBy\":\"Kvotheen-Hyjal\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"name\":\"Lyssabel Dawnpetal\"},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY\",\"type\":\"MONSTER_SAY\"},\"color\":{\"b\":0.6235294342041016,\"g\":1,\"r\":1},\"text\":\"Lyssabel Dawnpetal says: I do enjoy a good stroll about town. Let's see what plots are available.\",\"id\":\"s0_15\",\"timestamp\":1768932419},{\"recordedBy\":\"Kvotheen-Hyjal\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"name\":\"Lyssabel Dawnpetal\"},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY\",\"type\":\"MONSTER_SAY\"},\"color\":{\"b\":0.6235294342041016,\"g\":1,\"r\":1},\"text\":\"Lyssabel Dawnpetal says: And if you have any questions or find your options are too limited, please speak with me.\",\"id\":\"s0_16\",\"timestamp\":1768932426},{\"recordedBy\":\"Kvotheen-Hyjal\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"name\":\"Lyssabel Dawnpetal\"},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY\",\"type\":\"MONSTER_SAY\"},\"color\":{\"b\":0.6235294342041016,\"g\":1,\"r\":1},\"text\":\"Lyssabel Dawnpetal says: The island's earliest register mentions an amnesiac dwarf found in the surf. Though his true identity is lost to us, this bridge he built serves as his legacy.\",\"id\":\"s0_17\",\"timestamp\":1768932492},{\"recordedBy\":\"Kvotheen-Hyjal\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"name\":\"Lyssabel Dawnpetal\"},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY\",\"type\":\"MONSTER_SAY\"},\"color\":{\"b\":0.6235294342041016,\"g\":1,\"r\":1},\"text\":\"Lyssabel Dawnpetal says: The island's burial roll has been meticulously kept. Over fifty generations have called this place home. It is a fascinating read.\",\"id\":\"s0_18\",\"timestamp\":1768932514},{\"recordedBy\":\"Kvotheen-Hyjal\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"name\":\"Lyssabel Dawnpetal\"},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY\",\"type\":\"MONSTER_SAY\"},\"color\":{\"b\":0.6235294342041016,\"g\":1,\"r\":1},\"text\":\"Lyssabel Dawnpetal says: The beacon on the bluff is one of the island's most historic landmarks. It is the first light seen by ships bound for Stormwind Harbor.\",\"id\":\"s0_19\",\"timestamp\":1768932542},{\"recordedBy\":\"Kvotheen-Hyjal\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"name\":\"Lyssabel Dawnpetal\"},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY\",\"type\":\"MONSTER_SAY\"},\"color\":{\"b\":0.6235294342041016,\"g\":1,\"r\":1},\"text\":\"Lyssabel Dawnpetal says: In his logbook, Faldir expressed relief to find safe harbor here. This isle became a crucial foothold for the humans who first settled the south.\",\"id\":\"s0_20\",\"timestamp\":1768932566},{\"recordedBy\":\"Kvotheen-Hyjal\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"name\":\"Lyssabel Dawnpetal\"},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY\",\"type\":\"MONSTER_SAY\"},\"color\":{\"b\":0.6235294342041016,\"g\":1,\"r\":1},\"text\":\"Lyssabel Dawnpetal says: Though the crops come and go with the season, these fields, orchards, and arbors have been here longer than the city of Stormwind.\",\"id\":\"s0_21\",\"timestamp\":1768932593},{\"recordedBy\":\"Kvotheen-Hyjal\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"name\":\"Lyssabel Dawnpetal\"},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY\",\"type\":\"MONSTER_SAY\"},\"color\":{\"b\":0.6235294342041016,\"g\":1,\"r\":1},\"text\":\"Lyssabel Dawnpetal says: The locals have dubbed this hill the Small Aerie. Flocks of gryphons naturally tend to roost here.\",\"id\":\"s0_22\",\"timestamp\":1768932616},{\"recordedBy\":\"Kvotheen-Hyjal\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"class\":\"SHAMAN\",\"race\":\"ZandalariTroll\",\"name\":\"Kvotheen-Hyjal\",\"sex\":2},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_GUILD_ACHI