\"race\":\"EarthenDwarf\",\"class\":\"PALADIN\",\"name\":\"Yapludruhm-Hyjal\",\"sex\":2},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_GUILD\",\"type\":\"GUILD\"},\"color\":{\"b\":0.250980406999588,\"g\":1,\"r\":0.250980406999588},\"text\":\"|Hchannel:GUILD|h[Guild]|h |Hplayer:Yapludruhm-Hyjal:23:GUILD:|h[|cfff48cbaYapludruhm|r]|h: je vois pas de quoi tu parles ^^\",\"id\":\"s0_2253\",\"timestamp\":1772149065},{\"recordedBy\":\"Kvotheen-Hyjal\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"name\":\"Mehlar Dawnblade\"},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY\",\"type\":\"MONSTER_SAY\"},\"color\":{\"b\":0.6235294342041016,\"g\":1,\"r\":1},\"text\":\"Mehlar Dawnblade says: Kvotheen! The Vanguard is gathering at the north gate for a big push!\",\"id\":\"s0_2254\",\"timestamp\":1772149121},{\"recordedBy\":\"Kvotheen-Hyjal\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"name\":\"Aponi Brightmane\"},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY\",\"type\":\"MONSTER_SAY\"},\"color\":{\"b\":0.6235294342041016,\"g\":1,\"r\":1},\"text\":\"Aponi Brightmane says: Kvotheen, I thank the Light you are with us!\",\"id\":\"s0_2255\",\"timestamp\":1772149126},{\"recordedBy\":\"Kvotheen-Hyjal\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"name\":\"Nisa Cindersteel\"},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY\",\"type\":\"MONSTER_SAY\"},\"color\":{\"b\":0.6235294342041016,\"g\":1,\"r\":1},\"text\":\"Nisa Cindersteel says: The Light advances!\",\"id\":\"s0_2256\",\"timestamp\":1772149132},{\"recordedBy\":\"Kvotheen-Hyjal\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"race\":\"Orc\",\"class\":\"MONK\",\"name\":\"Øskytankul-Archimonde\",\"sex\":2},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_GUILD_ACHIEVEMENT\",\"type\":\"GUILD_ACHIEVEMENT\"},\"color\":{\"b\":0.250980406999588,\"g\":1,\"r\":0.250980406999588},\"text\":\"|Hplayer:Øskytankul-Archimonde|h[|cff00ff98Øskytankul-Archimonde|r]|h a accompli le haut fait |cffffff00|Hachievement:62273:Player-1302-0D33F4E1:1:2:27:26:4294967295:4294967295:4294967295:4294967295|h[Echoes of Midnight]|h|r !\",\"id\":\"s0_2257\",\"timestamp\":1772149154},{\"recordedBy\":\"Kvotheen-Hyjal\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"race\":\"Worgen\",\"class\":\"DRUID\",\"name\":\"Matrox-Eitrigg\",\"sex\":2},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_GUILD_ACHIEVEMENT\",\"type\":\"GUILD_ACHIEVEMENT\"},\"color\":{\"b\":0.250980406999588,\"g\":1,\"r\":0.250980406999588},\"text\":\"|Hplayer:Matrox-Eitrigg|h[|cffff7c0aMatrox-Eitrigg|r]|h a accompli le haut fait |cffffff00|Hachievement:62273:Player-1122-0B2B920E:1:2:27:26:4294967295:4294967295:4294967295:4294967295|h[Echoes of Midnight]|h|r !\",\"id\":\"s0_2258\",\"timestamp\":1772149166},{\"recordedBy\":\"Kvotheen-Hyjal\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"name\":\"High Exarch Turalyon\"},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY\",\"type\":\"MONSTER_SAY\"},\"color\":{\"b\":0.6235294342041016,\"g\":1,\"r\":1},\"text\":\"High Exarch Turalyon says: Lor'themar could have handled the evacuation, Arator. You're needed with the Vanguard!\",\"id\":\"s0_2259\",\"timestamp\":1772149167},{\"recordedBy\":\"Kvotheen-Hyjal\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"name\":\"High Exarch Turalyon\"},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY\",\"type\":\"MONSTER_SAY\"},\"color\":{\"b\":0.6235294342041016,\"g\":1,\"r\":1},\"text\":\"High Exarch Turalyon says: Vanguard of the Light, form a line! Hold this gate!\",\"id\":\"s0_2260\",\"timestamp\":1772149183},{\"recordedBy\":\"Kvotheen-Hyjal\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"name\":\"Quel'Danas Sentinel\"},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY\",\"type\":\"MONSTER_SAY\"},\"color\":{\"b\":0.6235294342041016,\"g\":1,\"r\":1},\"text\":\"Quel'Danas Sentinel says: Target acquired!\",\"id\":\"s0_2261\",\"timestamp\":1772149242},{\"recordedBy\":\"Kvotheen-Hyjal\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"name\":\"Arator\"},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY\",\"type\":\"MONSTER_SAY\"},\"color\":{\"b\":0.6235294342041016,\"g\":1,\"r\":1},\"text\":\"Arator says: Please forgive my father's tone. We don't always see eye-to-eye on things, to say the least.\",\"id\":\"s0_2262\",\"timestamp\":1772149242},{\"recordedBy\":\"Kvotheen-Hyjal\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"race\":\"ZandalariTroll\",\"class\":\"SHAMAN\",\"name\":\"Kvotheen-Hyjal\",\"sex\":2},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_LOOT\",\"type\":\"LOOT\"},\"color\":{\"b\":0,\"g\":0.6666666865348816,\"r\":0},\"text\":\"You receive loot: |cnIQ0:|Hitem:260659::::::::80:263:::::::::|h[Stellar Vortex Residue]|h|rx2\",\"id\":\"s0_2263\",\"timestamp\":1772149242},{\"recordedBy\":\"Kvotheen-Hyjal\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"name\":\"Quel'Danas Sentinel\"},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY\",\"type\":\"MONSTER_SAY\"},\"color\":{\"b\":0.6235294342041016,\"g\":1,\"r\":1},\"text\":\"Quel'Danas Sentinel says: Target acquired!\",\"id\":\"s0_2264\",\"timestamp\":1772149245},{\"recordedBy\":\"Kvotheen-Hyjal\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"name\":\"Vindicator Xayann\"},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY\",\"type\":\"MONSTER_SAY\"},\"color\":{\"b\":0.6235294342041016,\"g\":1,\"r\":1},\"text\":\"Vindicator Xayann says: Activating those sentinels could shift the balance in our favor.\",\"id\":\"s0_2265\",\"timestamp\":1772149249},{\"recordedBy\":\"Kvotheen-Hyjal\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"name\":\"Quel'Danas Sentinel\"},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY\",\"type\":\"MONSTER_SAY\"},\"color\":{\"b\":0.6235294342041016,\"g\":1,\"r\":1},\"text\":\"Quel'Danas Sentinel says: Target acquired!\",\"id\":\"s0_2266\",\"timestamp\":1772149254},{\"recordedBy\":\"Kvotheen-Hyjal\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"name\":\"Arator\"},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY\",\"type\":\"MONSTER_SAY\"},\"color\":{\"b\":0.6235294342041016,\"g\":1,\"r\":1},\"text\":\"Arator says: High Exarch Turalyon is a vaunted battlefield commander. Though... I think he sometimes forgets how to be anything else.\",\"id\":\"s0_2267\",\"timestamp\":1772149254},{\"recordedBy\":\"Kvotheen-Hyjal\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"name\":\"Quel'Danas Sentinel\"},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY\",\"type\":\"MONSTER_SAY\"},\"color\":{\"b\":0.6235294342041016,\"g\":1,\"r\":1},\"text\":\"Quel'Danas Sentinel says: Target acquired!\",\"id\":\"s0_2268\",\"timestamp\":1772149257},{\"recordedBy\":\"Kvotheen-Hyjal\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"name\":\"Arator\"},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY\",\"type\":\"MONSTER_SAY\"},\"color\":{\"b\":0.6235294342041016,\"g\":1,\"r\":1},\"text\":\"Arator says: You will not fall today!\",\"id\":\"s0_2269\",\"timestamp\":1772149296},{\"recordedBy\":\"Kvotheen-Hyjal\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"name\":\"Arator\"},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY\",\"type\":\"MONSTER_SAY\"},\"color\":{\"b\":0.6235294342041016,\"g\":1,\"r\":1},\"text\":\"Arator says: For all that creature's might, it was in such pain. When I was overcome by wrath, I lashed out in my pain. Is it the same for the Void as it is for the Light?\",\"id\":\"s0_2270\",\"timestamp\":1772149303},{\"recordedBy\":\"Kvotheen-Hyjal\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"name\":\"Quel'Danas Sentinel\"},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY\",\"type\":\"MONSTER_SAY\"},\"color\":{\"b\":0.6235294342041016,\"g\":1,\"r\":1},\"text\":\"Quel'Danas Sentinel says: Target acquired!\",\"id\":\"s0_2271\",\"timestamp\":1772149319},{\"recordedBy\":\"Kvotheen-Hyjal\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"name\":\"Arator\"},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY\",\"type\":\"MONSTER_SAY\"},\"color\":{\"b\":0.6235294342041016,\"g\":1,\"r\":1},\"text\":\"Arator says: The Vanguard has faith in the Light, and so do I. But I've also felt it fill me with wrath, and I... I'm not sure what to think when it does.\",\"id\":\"s0_2272\",\"timestamp\":1772149319},{\"recordedBy\":\"Kvotheen-Hyjal\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"name\":\"Quel'Danas Sentinel\"},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY\",\"type\":\"MONSTER_SAY\"},\"color\":{\"b\":0.6235294342041016,\"g\":1,\"r\":1},\"text\":\"Quel'Danas Sentinel says: Target acquired!\",\"id\":\"s0_2273\",\"timestamp\":1772149322},{\"recordedBy\":\"Kvotheen-Hyjal\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"race\":\"Orc\",\"class\":\"HUNTER\",\"name\":\"Dordok-Ysondre\",\"sex\":2},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_GUILD_ACHIEVEMENT\",\"type\":\"GUILD_ACHIEVEMENT\"},\"color\":{\"b\":0.250980406999588,\"g\":1,\"r\":0.2509804069995